 other bone diseases like bone tumors and osteoporosis diseases are compromising the bones, sneezing and coughing can result in spinal fractures in compression fractures. According to expert, it is most prevalent among elderly married women and patients with bone disease. In this circumstance, the patient experiences severe agony, loss of height, and back inclination.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(67, 67, 67)\">Burst fractures</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">This fracture is typical of accidents in which the primary bones are fractured in multiple orientations. In this circumstance, the patient cannot move at all and experiences extreme lethargy and anxiety. In comparison to other types of spinal fractures, the rupture fracture is the most severe. To diagnose the severity of an injury, an <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\">orthopedic physician</a> prefers to use MRIs, X-rays, and CT scans.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(67, 67, 67)\">Flexion-distraction fractures</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The flexion-distraction fracture&#39;s discomfort in the spinal cord is a result of the sudden car break&#39;s instantaneous jerk. Due to the untimely occurrence of flexion-distraction fractures, they are also known as &quot;chance fractures.&quot; In juveniles, flexion-distraction fractures most commonly occur in the thoracolumbar and mid-lumbar regions of the spine. The treatment for flexion-distraction fractures depends on the severity of the injury, and only an </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic surgeon</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> will recommend surgery and tests. For the safety of your vertebrae, it is recommended that you wear a seat belt and avoid driving aggressively.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Role of Orthopedic &amp; Physiotherapy in the Spinal Fracture Healing Process -</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Accidents can happen at any time, but the next thing that comes to mind is how to recover faster and return to daily life. When this type of incident occurs in the life of a patient, they are mentally and physically shattered. It is essential to have a companion who can educate, heal, and encourage you to improve your situation in order to combat this circumstance. Now, let&#39;s examine the repair process for these previously described spinal fractures.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">According to the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic doctor in baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">, it takes between six and twelve weeks for a spinal fracture to recover. However, once a bone is fractured, it is extremely unlikely to regain the same mobility and strength. As soon as the patient arrived at the hospital, a physical examination was performed to determine the type of spinal fracture. Then, if necessary, surgical and healing procedures commence. Age, gender, hormonal balance, and obesity are a few of the factors that affect treatment and recovery time. Dealing with this situation may require time and effort, but a skilled orthopedic surgeon can accomplish it. The orthopedic physician recommends physiotherapy sessions for improved mobility and bone movement. With the aid of tried-and-true <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-treatment\">physiotherapy techniques</a>, patients can recover more frequently and resume their normal activities.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Nutrition&#39;s Involvement in spinal fracture recovery</span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A balanced diet is recommended by nutritionists because a consistent dosage of medication aids in more than just immediate recovery. In addition to the medication, it is essential for the patient to ingest sufficient nutrients for wound healing and recovery from pain and cuts. For spinal fracture recovery, you need calcium, magnesium, vitamin D, and protein-rich foods. Dark leafy green vegetables, berries, oranges, fatty fish, nuts, and dairy products are some of the finest foods recommended in this article. Depending on the type of surgery and the patient, every nutrient platter is unique. For improved guidance, it is necessary to remain in contact with a qualified nutritionist.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Conclusion -&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">For effective treatment of prevalent injuries, it is necessary to consult with a healthcare professional. Today, we discussed spinal fractures and the importance of nutrients for a rapid recovery. Orthopedics and physiotherapy play crucial roles in enhancing the bone&#39;s flexibility and mobility following surgery for spinal fractures. Dr.Sumitz has the finest</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\"> orthopedic clinic in Baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">, and they have treated numerous patients with spinal fractures. The skilled and knowledgeable orthopedic team transforms the lives of patients and brings a smile to their faces.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/284000153_19_06_2023_05_11_20.webp','2023-06-19 11:41:20','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(89,'bones-and-joints-infections-types-symptoms-and-prevention','Bones and joints infections: Types, symptoms, and prevention','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','A bone infection is a bacterial or fungal infection of the bone. Despite being rare, this bone infection nonetheless causes a person a great deal of a...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A bone infection is a bacterial or fungal infection of the bone. Despite being rare, this bone infection nonetheless causes a person a great deal of agony and discomfort. The hip, spine, feet, legs, and arms are the most common locations for these bone infections. <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\">Bone infections</a> can affect people of all ages, but mainly young children and the elderly, according to the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic surgeon in Baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Types of infections in bones &amp; joints:&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Infection in the bones typically happens when bacteria and fungi in the body come into contact. They enter the body and spread their action throughout the entire body. The fragile organ begins to produce yellow pus, which erodes the body&#39;s fortitude. Let&#39;s now examine the four primary categories of bone and joint infections that can damage the body&#39;s bones and joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Osteomyelitis: bone inflammation</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Osteomyelitis is the medical word for the bone infection. This is a common infection of the bone, and elderly individuals who have osteoporosis are especially at risk of contracting it. The severity of osteomyelitis depends on the diagnosis. The staphylococcus bacteria were responsible for this infection in the bone.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Septic arthritis: Infection of the joint</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Septic arthritis is a common joint infection due to Staphylococcus aureus (staph). The specialists have proposed animal bites as an alternative reason. To receive treatment, a person must take anti-fungal medications and adhere to the advice of medical professionals. The dietitian suggested taking the medication and eating lots of fruits, vegetables, and foods high in protein.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Discitis : Intervertebral disc infection</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Diabetes individuals, young people, and older people have all been known to develop discitis. They are especially susceptible to this bone infection, which typically affects the body&#39;s spinal column. While moving, the patient experiences discomfort due to the pain.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Bone infection: Risk factors that you should know:</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The following is a list of the main risk factors for bone infection:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The two main causes of bone infections are bacteria and fungi.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">People with weakened immune systems are more susceptible to contracting the virus, particularly if they suffer from conditions like osteoporosis.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The contaminated syringe and open pores were also to blame for contact with the infections in the past if they underwent surgery using invasive methods and punctured techniques.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Poor cleanliness and an unsafe environment are the other non-medical risk factors, both of which can result in a number of health issues, including bone infections.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Symptoms and Consequences:</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Symptoms serve as alerts that bone health should take precedence, and early diagnosis spares a person from suffering. Now, if you exhibit any of the following symptoms of a bone infection, you shouldn&#39;t disregard them:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint and bone discomfort</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Pain, erythema, and swelling</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">On the wound, yellow pus might sometimes appear.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Sweating&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you have neglected these widespread signs, the bone may eventually stop growing. The meaning of this medical word is that there is no movement or blood flow. After examining the symptoms and warning signals, one can avoid a major procedure and excruciating suffering.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Measures to Prevent Bone Infection -&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Since fungus and bacteria are known to cause bone infections, maintaining good hygiene is essential if you want to avoid them.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Open wounds are the ideal entry point for external pathogens to enter the body since they cause infection when they come into touch with them. It is advised to conceal any wounds whenever you go outside because of this.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Keep the infection at a safe distance from the body by using protection. Your chances of avoiding infections increase as you take care of your wounds and avoid things that can spread infection.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">A robust immune system will prevent germs and fungus from ever entering the body. If they do, the body will be equipped to combat them and maintain protection if they do. Vaccines come in a variety of forms if you wish to strengthen your immune system. However, follow your knowledgeable doctor&#39;s instructions exactly when taking the prescription.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Healthy routines and behaviors are crucial for defending against viruses and diseases. The better it is for your health, the more you should concentrate on eating well and exercising.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">To comprehend the body&#39;s overall health, you must get regular checkups and assessments. Sometimes, physical changes are silent, which is why you need a professional who can recognize them and take advantage of them.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Conclusion -</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparen