e for a bone infection to heal?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As per the orthopedic doctor in Pune, the bone infection takes a minimum of 3 to 5 days and a maximum of 12 weeks.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">2. What kind of foods should you consume to prevent bone infections?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Some of the most popular foods that are nutrient-rich and advised by doctors during <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\">bone infections</a> are green leafy vegetables, fruits, dairy products, meats, and fish.</span></p>\r\n','uploads/product/535453302_19_06_2023_05_34_25.webp','2023-06-19 12:03:51','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(90,'physiotherapy-doctor-in-baner ','Physiotherapy Success Stories: Achieving the Impossible','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','In the healthcare industry, physiotherapy is the most important step to building a strong, flexible physique. We face challenges every day that disrup...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">In the healthcare industry, physiotherapy is the most important step to building a strong, flexible physique. We face challenges every day that disrupt the harmony between our physical and emotional well-being. The only way to restore balance in our lives is through physical therapy.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Physical therapy is an integral part of healthcare that helps in treating chronic diseases, recovering from injuries, and regaining mobility and independence. It is for anyone who wants to build strength and endurance in their body, not just for those with broken bones. A strong physique can handle any situation and protect against serious injuries. Most people have changed their lives for the better because of physiotherapy. We are sharing the touching stories of our orthopedic patients in Pune in this blog. You can see the doctors&rsquo; perseverance and the team&rsquo;s hard work reflected in the patients&rsquo; smiles.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">From Wheelchair to Walking: Suraj&#39;s Journey of Resilience-</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">When Suraj gets injured in a car accident, he is paralyzed below the waist. Suraj gives up hope that his life will never return to normal. But thanks to Dr. Sumitz&rsquo;s rehabilitation program, Suraj gets a new chance to live a happy and pain-free life. At our </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/how-to-find-the-best-physiotherapy-clinic-in-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">physiotherapy clinic in Pune</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, we provide comprehensive support for mobility and bone recovery. A person who is confined to a wheelchair now covers steps of a mile with their feet, and that is remarkable progress for Suraj. The fact that Suraj is still able to walk on his own is a testament to the miracle of physiotherapy.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Overcoming Chronic Pain: Sarah&#39;s Triumph over Fibromyalgia</strong>-</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Fibromyalgia is a complex illness that causes widespread muscle and joint pain and exhaustion. This pain has consumed Sarah&#39;s life, and she believes she will never fully recover. Looking for the &ldquo;best physiotherapist near me&rdquo;, she has visited several facilities but has not been able to find the right one. By implementing a holistic approach that includes manual therapy, exercise, and pain relief techniques at DR. Sumitz, Sarah has experienced significant pain relief and increased function. She may now be proud to live a healthy life and participate in the activities she enjoys. Sarah&rsquo;s success story shows how physiotherapy can be used to treat chronic pain and enhance the quality of life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>From Athlete to Amputee: Pankaj&#39;s Journey to Adaptive Sports</strong>-</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">It is important for an athlete to maintain the strength and flexibility of their body. With a healthy body, an athlete can dream of improving their performance and success in life. However, life takes a turn for the worse when an accident happens to them. Due to the accident, they lose their leg and also lose hope of pursuing their passion in the future.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">However, when he learned about adaptive sports through physiotherapy, he was surprised and excited to see the results. Under the guidance of an experienced physiotherapist, Dr. Sumitz, he has learned many techniques to enhance his game by using prosthetic limbs better. The encouragement and support of physiotherapists and specialists in Pune help them bring their skills back to the field. Today, he is ready to accept a new life through Dr. Sumitz&rsquo;s clinic and the passion and commitment of their team.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><strong>Conclusion</strong>-</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Our patients&#39; positive outcomes are a testament to the hard work of our staff. Motivates us to keep doing what we&#39;re doing and bringing joy to our patients&#39; lives. Today, we heard from patients whose ability to endure excruciating suffering changed their lives. Stories of recovery through physiotherapy are inspiring examples of the power of the human will and the significance of receiving professional care. Physiotherapy has been shown to be a driver for change in a wide variety of contexts, including helping people regain mobility after horrific injuries, controlling chronic diseases, and excelling in adaptive sports. Now is the time to see our </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blog/physiotherapist-in-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">physiotherapist in Pune</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> if you&#39;ve been experiencing any pain, especially in the joints, or if you want to improve your performance by strengthening your bones.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/199471066_04_08_2023_01_31_33.webp','2023-08-04 07:59:21','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(91,'common-orthopedic-injuries-get-instant-recovery-from-the-dr-sumitz-clinic','Common Orthopedic Injuries: Get instant recovery from the Dr. Sumitz Clinic','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Seeking out the top orthopedic surgeon in Pune for a speedy recovery?\r\n\r\nInjuries can prevent you from participating in your daily activities. If you...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Seeking out the top </span><strong>orthopedic surgeon in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> for a speedy recovery?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Injuries can prevent you from participating in your daily activities. If you want to improve your mobility and your quality of life, then you need to protect yourself from sudden injury and enhance your quality of life. Accidents, sports, repetitive motion, and other factors can all cause injuries. These are just a few of the reasons that cause injuries to bones, joints, and ligaments. In order to recover quickly without interrupting your daily routine, you need to stay in contact with the</span><strong> top orthopedic doctors in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">. In this article, you will learn about the most common types of injuries in the field of orthopedics, and we will also introduce the best </span><strong>orthopedic and <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/how-to-find-the-best-physiotherapy-clinic-in-pune\">physiotherapy clinics in Pune</a></strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> for musculoskeletal and sports-related injuries.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Here are the most common Orthopedic Injuries that can affect patients&#39; lives</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The injuries are normal and can happen to anyone at any age. But the </span><strong>best <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\">orthopedic surgeon in Pune</a></strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> will always guide you in a better way to return to normal life. Also, physiotherapy is the best alternative to minimize the risk of injuries and add value to a lifestyle.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Sprains and Strains:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">A sprain occurs when ligaments are stretched or torn, while a strain occurs when a muscle or tendon is stretched or torn. Sudden movement, a fall, or poor lifting technique are common causes of sprains and strains. These are the most common injuries that interfere with your mental and physical well-being.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Fractures:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Fractures are fractures that occur when a bone breaks. They can happen as a result of an accident, a fall, or excessive force on the bone. Fracture conditions reduce the chance for the patient to return to normal. Fractures can be minor or serious, depending on the nature of the accident. Reconnecting the broken bones can take up to a month.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Tendinitis:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Tendinitis is the inflammation or irritation of a tendon. Tendinitis is most commonly caused by repetitive movement or overuse of the tendon. Symptoms of tendinitis include - pain in the injured tendon, a lump on the affected tendon, and a loss of range of motion.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Rotator Cuff Injuries:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The rotator cuff ligaments are a group of tendons and muscles that hold the shoulder joint in place. Repetitive overhead movements or sudden trauma to the rotator cuff ligaments can both result in rotator cuff injuries. In these cases, the patient may have muscle weakness, bone-shaking noises, and grating sensations.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Osteoarthritis:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">As you get older, your bones start to break down more easily. This can affect your mobility and the way your body functions. This is one of the most common problems that older adults face. The main cause of this condition is not yet known, but you should consult your </span><strong>orthopedic doctor at Baner&rsquo;s best clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> for tips on prevention and treatment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Prevention Tips that you should not ignore in order to prevent injuries are suggested by the best orthopedic doctor in Pune</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Warm-up and Stretching:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Orthopedic doctors </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">always advise warm-ups and stretching to improve flexibility and reduce the risk of sprains and strains.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Proper Technique:&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If you don&rsquo;t know how to lift heavy objects, play sports, or exercise, you risk putting your joints and muscles under unnecessary strain. That&rsquo;s why it&rsquo;s important to use proper form and technique before you start any exercise.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Protective Gear:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The athlete is obligated to wear protective equipment such as helmets and knee and elbow pads to avoid injuries to the body. In addition to the game, you should not neglect your body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Rest and Recovery:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If any injury happens to your body, then make sure that it gets proper rest and healing. Do not put any strain on your body; if you do, it may lead to other serious problems. Talk to your </span><strong>Pune orthopedic doctor</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> about the timing of your rest and healing.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Conclusion -</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Prevention is the best cure for an orthopedic injury. By adopting better habits and taking precautionary actions, patients can recover from an injury in a short period of time. The most common types of injuries that a person experiences once in their lifetime are sprains/strains/injuries to the shoulder, hip, back, knee, ankle, and other joints. Osteoarthritis/fractures, tendinitis, etc. In order to deal with an injury in a more effective manner, physiotherapy should be the first and most effective way to get instant healing. With the support of a proper treatment plan and the expertise of an </span><strong>orthopedic and physiotherapy clinic in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, you will never regret it later in life. Now is the time to stay active and healthy with proper guidance and treatment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/177205662_10_08_2023_11_47_27.webp','2023-08-10 06:17:27','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(92,'the-pain-proof-diet-a-step-by-step-guide-to-losing-weight-after-an-injury','The Pain-Proof Diet: A Step-by-Step Guide to Losing Weight After an Injury','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','After an injury, are you willing to shed weight? The most qualified nutritionist in Pune, working at Dr. Sumitz&#39;s orthopedic clinic, additionally...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After an injury, are you willing to shed weight? The most qualified nutritionist in Pune, working at Dr. Sumitz&#39;s orthopedic clinic, additionally provides the best guidance on this topic.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Injuries are depressing and can cause major disruptions in your daily routine. On top of that, many are really worried about putting on too much weight. In order to heal from an accident, we need to eat foods that suppress the pain and restore strength during the rehabilitation process. Nutritionally, we need to focus on eating a balanced diet high in protein, fiber, vitamins, and healthy fats. As a result, it causes weight gain and increases stress for fitness enthusiasts. For those enthusiasts who are looking to lose weight quickly and easily, the nutritionist at Dr. Sumitz&#39;s orthopedic clinic is sharing some helpful tips in this blog.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Consult Your Nutritionist and dietitian -&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">A post-injury diet plan necessitates discussion with a nutritionist or dietitian after any kind of injury. They will help you assess the current state of your injuries and develop a healthy eating plan to complement your weight-loss efforts. You will find the most qualified group of dietitians to help you lose weight safely at the orthopedic and physiotherapy clinic of Dr. Sumitz in Pune. The individualized treatment plan for a patient does not in any way interfere with their regular routine.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Focus on Nutrition -&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">During the weight loss journey, the majority of people skip meals to attain their desired physique. But this is not a recommended suggestion from the dietitian expert, and if you have experienced the trauma of injury before, then you need to take care of a nutrition diet for healthy weight gain. The dietitian at Dr. Sumitz&#39;s clinic suggests that the platter should include vitamins, minerals, and proteins. Always prefer fresh vegetables, whole grains, and lean proteins. For better results over a long period of time, it is important to cut out sugary and processed foods that have a negative impact on the body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Start Slowly with exercise -&nbsp;</span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Regular activity plays an important role in minimizing the risk of injuries. But after injuries, you need to take advice from a physiotherapist for suitable exercises. Before following their advice, never hit the gym door or put any kind of strain on the body in order to lose weight. The physiotherapy doctor in Pune at Dr. Sumitz Clinic examines the situation of the injury and then creates a customized and personalized plan for prompt recovery. He knows better which part of the bone needs more strain and which one does not. Gradually, he modifies the duration and exercises for better strength and mobility of the body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Embrace Strength training -&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Strength training should be a regular part of your exercise routine if you want to gain lean muscle. Having more muscle can increase your metabolism and help you burn more calories, even when you&#39;re at rest. Choose exercises that strengthen the surrounding muscles rather than the damaged ones. You can tone and build your muscles with the help of resistance bands and modest weights without putting too much strain on your body. With the assistance of the physiotherapist in Pune, the patient can regain their metabolism and strength.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Practice Mindful eating -&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Mindful eating can help you heal from emotional eating and form a healthier connection with food. For healthy and strong bones, calcium, iron, and protein are necessary, and if you want more guidance regarding the diet plan, you can connect with the best dietitian experts at the Dr.Sumitz Clinic. Eat when you&#39;re hungry, but take your time and enjoy every meal. Don&#39;t eat in front of the television or while otherwise distracted. In addition, maintaining a meal journal can help you notice any trends or triggers in your eating habits.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Stay Hydrated -&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Water is crucial for good health and might even help with weight loss. Maintaining an adequate water intake aids in satiety regulation, appetite suppression, and the promotion of natural healing processes. As per the dietitian at the Dr. Sumitz clinic, an individual needs to intake 8&ndash;10 glasses of water every day. If you aren&rsquo;t willing to drink plain water, then you can add flavors of juice and detox water. Keep a water bottle on hand to help you remember to drink throughout the day, but also pay attention to your body and drink when you&#39;re thirsty.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Be Patient and Realistic -&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">It&#39;s normal to take more time than anticipated to lose weight after an accident. With the assistance of the best </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-treatment\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">physiotherapist in Pune</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, you can make plans you can actually follow through on and enjoy the fruits of your labors, no matter how modest. Everyone&#39;s body and healing process are different, so it&#39;s best not to compare yours to anyone else&#39;s. It&#39;s important to keep in mind that the only way to lose weight permanently is to make permanent adjustments to one&#39;s lifestyle.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Conclusion -&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Maintaining a healthy weight loss regimen while recovering from an injury requires a well-rounded strategy. Pay close attention to what you eat, how you exercise, and how consistent you are in both. Never make drastic changes to your diet or fitness regimen without first talking to your dietitian. Today we have listed the best suggestions of the dietitian in Baner that include consultation with an expert, focusing on nutrition, regular activity, mindful eating, and proper hydration. Following these tips will definitely help you achieve the goal of weight loss after a tragic injury incident. The Dr. Sumitz Clinic is the best orthopedic and </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/how-to-find-the-best-physiotherapy-clinic-in-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">physiotherapy clinic in Pune</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> and has the best team to guide patients to regain strength after an injury or severe accident. Know that a healthy recovery is the ultimate reward for your efforts to lose weight, and let those qualities guide you as you make progress.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/837680381_12_08_2023_05_38_13.webp','2023-08-12 12:08:13','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(93,'top-benefits-of-office-ergonomics-in-the-workplace','Top Benefits Of Office Ergonomics In The Workplace ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','The ergonomics subject deals with the working positions and placement of the product or system in the workplace. It is crucial to understand more abou...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The ergonomics subject deals with the working positions and placement of the product or system in the workplace. It is crucial to understand more about this topic if you work in an office to increase your body&#39;s productivity. The improper placement of your system and a lack of knowledge about proper sitting positions at the office might impose additional strain on your bones and muscles. As a result, it could impair mental focus and make you less interested in your work.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Personal health and professional development are intimately correlated; when employees are healthy, there is a greater possibility that the company will see a rise in revenue. A healthy body and good posture at work encourage focus and concentration. Additionally, it boosts output and lowers absences from work due to fatigue and other health issues. More advantages of ergonomics and the ideal body posture that support a healthy lifestyle are shared in this blog.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Enhanced comfort:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Once you&#39;ve learned about ergonomics, you&#39;ll never again have to put up with headaches, muscle strain, or exhaustion on the job. The key to enjoying a productive and relaxed workday is a healthy sitting and standing posture. This is why you need to give some thought to ergonomic concepts if you want a healthier workplace. Maintaining a steady stance promotes psychological and physiological equilibrium.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Reduced strain and fatigue:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Every day, the cumulative effect of physical exhaustion and stress will take its toll, causing you to lose focus and decrease your output. If you want to lessen the strain on your neck, eyes, and back, and increase your productivity, you should talk to them about the ideal way to sit in front of the computer, laptop, keyboard, and mouse.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Improved posture:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The two most important things that negatively affect your posture at work are - the style of chair you use and the placement of your working system. Therefore, poor posture will diminish your persona and public image. Instead, sit up straight and take short rests to let your body recover from the strain of prolonged sitting. On the other side, if poor posture is causing you pain, contact the</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lower health issues:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Prolonged sitting in an office has been linked to an increase in health problems such as carpal tunnel syndrome, repetitive strain injuries, back discomfort, and degenerative joint disease. Ergonomics is the most effective method for reducing these health problems. You&#39;ll be more productive at work and need less time off sick if you feel comfortable at your workplace.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Increased focus and concentration:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">When your bones or joints hurt all the time, it&#39;s impossible to concentrate on your tasks. Intense suffering can cause bones to break or fracture, sometimes permanently. Better achievements can be achieved at work with nothing more than focus and concentration. With ergonomics, you can achieve peace and a calm, relaxed body that leads to improved concentration.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Promote a healthy work culture:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">An ergonomics-based program that educates workers on the ideal sitting position minimizes health-related issues and encourages a healthy work culture. This maximizes efficiency on the job and has potential health benefits for workers in the long run.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Better mental health:</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">You can&#39;t get anything done if your mind isn&#39;t functioning properly. When you&#39;re feeling well on the inside, your thinking is better, and you want to sit in the same chair every day because it&#39;s bliss. Consult with the best physiotherapist in Pune about ergonomics and attain the pinnacle of comfort.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Some of the ergonomic tips that you should not neglect while working in the office</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Make sure to sit at a 135-degree angle, because this will not put more strain on your body.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">As per the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic doctor in Baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">, it is recommended for healthy bones to spend 30 minutes in the morning on any activity.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Instead of using elevators, use stairs to reach the upper floor. This will burn calories and also allow the body to indulge in activity.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">It is okay to have a mobile for messaging, but try to avoid phones for further messaging or chats and involve yourself in social gatherings with your colleagues.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Invest in a high-quality ergonomic keyboard, ergonomic mouse, and ergonomic office chair for convenience.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The monitor on the computer should be at eye level to avoid straining the eyes.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Ensure that there is a minimal bend of the wrist or elbow and that everything is in a balanced position.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Always sit in a relaxed position and don&rsquo;t put a strain on any part of the body to prevent pain.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">If you have any bone-related issues, consult with the right orthopedic doctor in Pune for a faster recovery.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Make sure to eat a calcium- and vitamin-D-rich diet for healthy and strong bones.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Conclusion -</span></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">People in today&#39;s fast-paced society pay a lot of attention to their jobs and other means of earning a living. This is why they keep going, no matter what the cost to their health. Fatigue, muscle weakness, skeletal discomfort, and an inability to focus are just some of the side effects of this bad habit. Ergonomics is the study and application of how people move in their environments to prevent injury and maximize productivity. Furthermore, ergonomics aids in decreasing health problems, improving comfort, fostering a healthy work environment, and reducing strain or fatigue The experts at the Dr. Sumitz Clinic are well-versed in answering questions about ergonomics. Get in touch with the top orthopedic and </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/how-to-find-the-best-physiotherapy-clinic-in-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">physiotherapy center in Pune</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> for all your bone and joint care needs.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/645144044_12_08_2023_05_53_32.webp','2023-08-12 12:23:32','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(94,'exploring-the-benefits-of-back-pain-treatment-in-pune','Exploring the Benefits of Back Pain Treatment in Pune','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Does chronic back pain hinder mobility and productivity? If this seems like something you&#39;ve experienced, you should visit Dr. Sumitz Clinic, the...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Does chronic back pain hinder mobility and productivity? If this seems like something you&#39;ve experienced, you should visit Dr. Sumitz Clinic, the top orthopedic clinic in Pune for treating musculoskeletal problems.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Back pain is a common form of discomfort that can affect people of any age. Back discomfort can have several causes, some of which include overtraining, poor posture, a lack of vitamin D, and other factors. We are not meant to suffer throughout our lives, which is why it is imperative that we discover new means of pain management. Dr.Sumitz, an </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic specialist in Baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, can help with your back pain and any other musculoskeletal problems you may be having. Today, we&#39;d like to go into greater detail about why his clinic is the best option for treating back pain in Pune. The </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-treatment\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">physiotherapy</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> and </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/orthopaedic-treatment\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic treatment</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> facilities in Pune offer an incredible opportunity for locals to improve their health and well-being.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Here are the following benefits that you can experience at the orthopedic clinic in Pune:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Back discomfort used to only affect the elderly, but today, because of sedentary lifestyles, poor eating habits, excessive alcohol consumption, and smoking, it&#39;s a widespread complaint among people of all ages. The vertebrae in your back are the structural cornerstones that keep everything else in your body running smoothly. Now that the ball is in your court, research the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic specialist in Baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> to find out how they can assist you in taking care of the situation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Assessment and Diagnosis -</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">You can&#39;t begin treating a problem or administering medication unless you find out what&#39;s causing it. The evaluation and diagnosis of back pain is therefore a top focus for the medical staff at the Dr. Sumitz Clinic. Back pain can have a variety of causes, including but not limited to heredity, previous injuries or accidents, abrupt falls, and many others. After making a full diagnosis, they begin the necessary treatment.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Personalized treatment plans -</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Now that we know what&#39;s causing the back discomfort, we can formulate a strategy to treat it and get better outcomes. We tailor each patient&#39;s treatment plan to their specific needs and circumstances. After the procedure, other therapies, such as physiotherapy, chiropractic care, and others, may be necessary. The staff at the Dr. Sumitz Clinic keeps this in mind and collaborates with the patient to ensure a positive outcome. The best part about this orthopedic clinic in Pune is that the team of doctors will visit the patient at home after treatment as well to ensure the best possible outcome.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Holistic approach -</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The right physician not only alleviates suffering but also makes sure their patient never has to go through it again. The holistic treatment offered at the Dr. Sumitz Clinic can help patients feel valued, relieved of anxiety, and content. Patients are able to resume their regular lives thanks to the cutting-edge facility&#39;s state-of-the-art medical equipment and the expert care of the staff.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Pain management and Rehabilitation -</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Disruptions to the patient&#39;s routine, such as those caused by therapy for back pain, can have negative effects on the patient&#39;s emotional well-being. You won&#39;t have to deal with pain for very long due to the Dr. Sumitz Clinic&#39;s orthopedic specialists. A group of physiotherapists and a rehabilitation division work together to provide rapid pain relief and rehabilitation. We take routine follow-ups and refrain from examining the patient&#39;s condition until we have final confirmation of the patient&#39;s health.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Enhance the quality of life -</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">With the help of the professionals at the Dr. Sumitz Clinic, patients can lead healthier, more worry-free lives. People can&#39;t afford to take too much time off work to visit the hospital these days, so a rapid recovery is always a possibility. There are several advantages to collaborating with the Dr. Sumitz Clinic, including the treatment of the musculoskeletal system and the enhancement of the body&#39;s performance. Because of this, people&#39;s standard of living rises.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Conclusion&nbsp;-</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Effective treatment for back pain allows patients to quickly overcome their condition and return to regular functioning. However, with the aid of a proper orthopedic doctor in Pune, you will be able to get an accurate diagnosis and develop a tailored treatment plan to alleviate your back pain. Assessment and diagnosis, individualized treatment plans, pain management and rehabilitation, a holistic approach, and improving quality of life are just some of the methods used in Dr. Sumitz&#39;s orthopedic clinic. In addition, they offer home visits in case patients can&#39;t get to the clinic for any reason. If you are one of the many people who experience recurring back pain despite regular adjustments to their sleeping arrangements (such as a new pillow or mattress), then it is time to contact the top </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">orthopedic clinic in Pune</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"> so that you can get back to living a fulfilling life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/818196550_14_08_2023_12_30_05.webp','2023-08-14 05:58:10','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(95,'7-tips-to-avoid-orthopedic-issues-for-pregnant-ladies','7 Tips to Avoid Orthopedic Issues for Pregnant Ladies','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Pregnancy-associated osteoporosis (PAO) is a condition in which a woman experiences bone loss, most notably in the clavicle or collarbone, after child...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pregnancy-associated osteoporosis (PAO) is a condition in which a woman experiences bone loss, most notably in the clavicle or collarbone, after childbirth. Bone loss is one of the numerous pregnancy-related health issues. Pregnancy is a wonderful time that every woman looks forward to. The mother&#39;s mental and physical well-being begins to shift as early as the first week of pregnancy. The most common causes of bone loss are poor dietary habits, excessive alcohol intake, tobacco use, and genetic predisposition.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Orthopedic problems during pregnancy can be difficult to manage, but now a </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>doctor in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> offers some tips for doing so. If you are a week or month pregnant, you shouldn&#39;t ignore the most important piece of advice because it pertains to the health of both you and your developing child.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Take a glimpse at the 7 steps to avoid orthopedic issues for pregnant ladies from an orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Bone loss is normal during pregnancy, states an </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><strong>orthopedic surgeon in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, and it can be repaired once menstrual cycles return to normal. Keep the following in mind to avoid orthopedic problems until the very end of your pregnancy:&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Increase calcium intake</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The development of strong muscles and bones depends on the consumption of calcium. Eating well before, during, and after pregnancy is crucial for bone health. That&#39;s why it&#39;s so important to have adequate calcium in your diet, not only during pregnancy but for the rest of your life. Calcium can be found in a variety of foods, including milk and cheese, almonds, sardines, spinach, cereals, and tofu. According to the health dietician at the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">, pregnant women should consume 3&ndash;4 portions of food per day and undergo routine checkups to monitor their nutrient intake.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Vitamin-D-rich food</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In addition to calcium, the body also needs vitamin D, which helps to keep calcium levels steady and promotes bone density and strength. Soy milk, orange juice, cereals, sunlight, canned tuna, mushrooms, tuna fish, and egg yolk are all good sources of vitamin D. Vitamin D intake of 600 IU is recommended for the average pregnant woman to ensure healthy bones. Vitamin D is essential during nursing for the development of strong bones in the infant. Maintaining contact with medical professionals is essential for learning about maternal and infant health.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Avoid alcohol and caffeine</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Coffee and alcohol intake during pregnancy might have negative effects on both mother and kid. Alcohol&#39;s harmful chemicals have been linked to a wide variety of birth defects, premature birth, prematurity, miscarriage, and stillbirth. Keep your distance from these two things if you want to have a healthy baby. Limiting coffee and nicotine-based drinks in favor of juices and other healthy alternatives can improve your child&#39;s health.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Take physiotherapy sessions</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pregnant ladies should exercise more caution whenever they move. She should see a </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>physiotherapist in Pune</strong></a><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">to help her bones and joints move and function more smoothly. A qualified physiotherapist will assess the pregnant woman&#39;s condition and then advise on the best exercises to loosen up her tight core, joints, and muscles. Pregnancy can be a painful time, but with regular physiotherapy treatments, you can strengthen your bones to help you through it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Bone density tests</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pregnant women need to have their bone density checked to identify potentially damaged bones. However, it is also useful in determining whether or not a woman has osteoporosis or osteopenia. The condition of your bones and the steps you can take to strengthen them should be of utmost importance if you want to enjoy optimal physical health. Women under the age of 65 or those with a medical history should get a bone density test. However, this test might help determine if the expecting mother has a history of mishaps or falls.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Maintain posture</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">It&#39;s crucial to maintain a healthy posture during pregnancy. The danger of developing bone problems is raised when one tends to lean forward and maintains that posture while sitting or sleeping. The baby will be more comfortable if the mother maintains a straight and healthy posture that does not put undue pressure on any one area of the body. Consult a physiotherapist in Pune to find out more about ergonomics and correct posture for women.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Use support gear</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pregnant women can also benefit from the use of supportive equipment, just like athletes. She can improve their physical performance with the help of a variety of pregnancy-specific accessories. Wearing shoes with adequate arch support makes walking on any surface, including tile floors, easier.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pregnant women&#39;s health, including their bones and joints, is of paramount importance to their families and doctors. Keep the following advice from an expert orthopedic surgeon in Pune in mind to shield her from the potentially fatal event: Preventing falls and injuries requires a number of lifestyle changes, including eating a nutritious diet rich in calcium and vitamin D, not drinking alcohol or coffee, and using support equipment. Consult a trained physiotherapist in Pune to increase your range of motion and ease any conceiving-related discomforts. In order to reduce the potential for complications during delivery and improve the odds of a healthy upbringing, you should visit Dr. Sumitz Clinic, the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><strong>top orthopedic clinic in Baner</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">.</span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/107579418_29_08_2023_06_46_05.webp','2023-08-29 13:16:05','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(96,'digital-opg-facility-a-journey','Digital OPG Facility: A Journey to a Brighter and Radiant Smile','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Do you feel embarrassed smiling in public because of your teeth&#39;s misalignment or another flaw? Well, nothing to be worried about, as you have the...','<p><em>Do you feel embarrassed smiling in public because of your teeth&#39;s misalignment or another flaw? Well, nothing to be worried about, as you have the </em><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/digital-opg-facility\"><em>best digital OPG facilities clinic in Pune</em></a><em>,</em><em> Dr. Sumitz, where we are offering a solution to smile independently in front of anyone.</em></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">From being the core part of the digestive system to complementing your smile, teeth play a major role. There are around 32 teeth in the mouth of an adult, and as we grow older, complications become more common because of our habits. Discoloration of the tooth, ache or sensitivity, gum disease, broken or chipped teeth, and mouth cavity These issues lead to the weakening of the gums and disturb the daily activities of an individual.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">To 