ntists. To deal with the various issues with the teeth, this device has been discovered to make the treatment effective.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">There are the following </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/digital-opg-facility\"><strong>types of digital OPG facilities</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, and here we have listed each one that is required based on the requirement.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Intraoral X-ray&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Extraoral X-ray&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As per the experts, intraoral X-ray is more effective and has various uses than extraoral X-ray. From rising issues to the overall health of the teeth, an intraoral X-ray gives precise details about the teeth. But extraoral X-rays give a rare view of the teeth, skull, and jaw apart from the detailed mouth overview.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Pros of the digital OPG facility</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After understanding the workings, types, and purpose of the digital OPG facility, here are the following</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">pros of digital OPG that you should consider:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">With the help of the</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">state-of-the-art Digital OPG machine, you can get a precise and clear image of your overall mouth. Due to the high-resolution image quality, you can see every bit of the mouth so that the dentist can better identify the issue.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Thanks to modern technology, the Digital OPG facility will assist you in displaying the panoramic view of the mouth on a single image.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The digital OPG facility is a non-invasive method where you don&rsquo;t need to feel worried about bleeding, cuts, or any kind of physical hurt. This is a pain-free treatment that has no downtime and can occur in a short span of time.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Along with the diagnosis of the health of the mouth, there are also other applications of the digital OPG, including orthodontics, oral surgery, TMJ assessment, and dental implants.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Do you feel anxious about the excessive radiation exposure-based treatment? Then digital OPG is the best option for you, which will be a lifesaver from harmful radiation used in medical therapy.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This process</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">avoids the consumption of time and can occur within 14&ndash;20 minutes, so it won&rsquo;t cut off the time for the rest of the necessary work of your daily routine.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Precautions before undergoing the digital OPG treatment</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">So if you are someone who is planning to undergo digital OPG, then here are the following things that you should take care of:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Give priority to consultation and do it one-on-one with the expert dentist.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Keep all your ears open to the pre-and post-instructions of the dentist after having a digital OPG facility.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Feel free to ask related questions about the digital OPG or the treatment without hesitation.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Wear comfortable clothes without any jewelry or accessories while stepping into the OPG-equipped room.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Ensure that you discuss each and every detail about your medical history, ongoing medication, and other issues related to teeth prior to treatment.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The cost of the digital OPG treatment</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">process is easy to manage and won&rsquo;t break the bank. Make sure this process is done under the supervision of expert doctors or a reliable digital OPG facility. Also, the treatment cost depends on various factors, but you should not feel worried about it if you have chosen the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>Dr. Sumitz Clinic</strong></a><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">for this process.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">&nbsp;</span><strong>What can you expect from the clinic of DR.SUMITZ?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If you are looking for the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/digital-opg-facility\"><strong>best digital OPG facility in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, then no other clinic will be better than Dr. Sumitz. In this clinic, you will come across expert doctors who have been working in this medical field for so long and have treated several problems related to musculoskeletal issues and oral health.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">They are well equipped with state-of-the-art equipment to provide the best quality treatment. The environment all around is hygienic and provides cost-effective treatment; they also offer a facility where they visit the patient at their home. So if you are coming to this clinic, then it is a guarantee that you will achieve your goal of smiling brighter and more radiantly.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The </span>digital OPG facility<span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is an effective procedure to diagnose and examine the overall health of your mouth. Incorporating technology into the medical facility brings a revolution in medical history. Gives precise detail and makes the procedure effortless without consuming too much time. Similarly, having a digital OPG machine is a blissful thing because it takes care of your oral health and diagnoses the issue before it takes a major aspect. So if you are looking for the best digital OPG-based clinic in Pune, then Dr. Sumitz welcomes you with a complete heart. With the assistance of expert and reliable clinics, everything is possible to meet the goals of healthy living.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/19586089_06_09_2023_01_37_24.webp','2023-09-06 08:07:24','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(97,'reasons-for-shoulder-dislocations','The top 5 Reasons for Shoulder Dislocations that you should know','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','&nbsp;Athletes frequently experience serious issues, including shoulder dislocations, due to their participation in sports. Fortunately, a shoulder di...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Athletes frequently experience serious issues, including shoulder dislocations, due to their participation in sports. Fortunately, a shoulder dislocation is not life-threatening, but finding a good </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><strong>orthopedic surgeon in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is essential for a speedy recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The shoulder bone, according to an </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/best-way-to-choose-orthopedic-near-me-from-baner-pune\"><strong>orthopedic doctor in Baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, is a mobile and movable structure. This means that people may get the most out of their day-to-day activities, such as hitting the ball, catching, and other sports activities. When the ball and socket of the shoulder joint separate, it leads to shoulder dislocation. As a result, the patient may experience distress and be unable to carry on with daily tasks. Shoulder dislocation can occur for a number of reasons, and we&#39;ll go over some of the most common ones here, along with some tips for avoiding them.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Here are the following reasons for shoulder dislocations listed by the team of orthopedic doctors in Pune&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Falls and accidents</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Shoulder dislocation is most commonly caused by falls and accidents. This slip may occur on a slick surface. However, accidents and dislocation concerns arise when drivers or pedestrians act hastily, such as when crossing the road.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Activities like overhead movements</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Sportspeople make exercise a regular part of their routine. Shoulder dislocations are common among athletes because of the repetitive overhead motion that occurs during intense training. Pain and difficulty moving the shoulder are experienced as a result of the quick jerk.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Muscle weakness</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Muscle weakness can be attributed to insufficient protein, vitamins, and minerals. Muscle weakening, a common result of repetitive motions, is an important risk factor for shoulder dislocations.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Genetic or heredity</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If you have the same health problems as your parents or grandparents, it&#39;s due to a hereditary disease that has been passed down through the generations. Inherited bone weakness and shoulder dislocation are both conditions that can have significant lifelong consequences.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Repetitive stress injuries or RSI</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Injuries to overworked muscles, tendons, ligaments, and other connective tissue are the most prevalent form of tissue damage in the body. Athletes are especially vulnerable to repetitive stress injuries, which can affect any part of the body that is used regularly, including the shoulder. Some of the most frequent signs of repetitive stress injury (RSI) are pain, stiffness, tingling, numbness, and weakness in the affected muscles.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">There&#39;s no need to worry; there are plenty of solutions that can help you feel better and get back to life as usual. A qualified orthopedic surgeon in Pune</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">can assess your condition and provide the best course of treatment to alleviate your pain. For long-term health benefits, they also offer rehabilitation and other treatments related to quick healing and comfort.</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">You need the advice of a qualified orthopedic surgeon in Pune if you want to avoid shoulder dislocation and the associated pain. Take precautions to avoid accidents like slips, trips, and falls, as well as overtraining, muscle fatigue, and repetitive motion injuries. Focus on getting enough of the nutrients you need, such as protein, in a healthy, well-rounded diet. Additionally, if you are going to try out new sorts of shoulder exercises, now is the time to do so under the guidance of an </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapist\"><strong>expert physiotherapist in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> to avoid pain and discomfort. At the</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Dr. Sumitz Clinic, you&#39;ll find the finest group of orthopedic surgeons and</span><strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/knee-arthritis\"><strong>KNEE ARTHRITIS</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, all of whom will work tirelessly to alleviate your pain and restore your quality of life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/512456988_08_09_2023_12_16_34.webp','2023-09-08 06:46:34','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(98,'bmd-or-bone-mineral-density-test','BMD OR BONE MINERAL DENSITY TEST: PEOPLE ABOVE 20 YEARS MUST GO FOR THIS TEST; HERE IS WHY','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','For a healthy life, we need to have healthy bones, which occur when you have the proper amount of vitamins, minerals, proteins, and other nutrients in...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">For a healthy life, we need to have healthy bones, which occur when you have the proper amount of vitamins, minerals, proteins, and other nutrients in your bones. But how can we identify these nutrients in bones? Well, here we have the BMD SCAN TEST that helps to examine the health of bones and the proportion of nutrients in the right amount.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Dr. Sumitz is a proficient</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\"> </span><strong>orthopedic surgeon in Pune</strong></a><strong>, </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">and they advised that people over 20 or under 60 should have a BMD test. In this age duration, if you start losing bone mass and strength more often, then there is a question mark in healthy survival. This is also the age where bone formation gets reduced and destruction remains at its peak. With the help of the BMD test, you can identify the risks, threats, and proportions of nutrients. As per this examination, the doctor can recommend better medication, suggestions, and treatment options to restore bone health. In most hospitals, BMD testing is also known as DEXA or dual-energy X-ray absorptiometry. If you want to know more about this test, including who needs it the most and the best orthopedic clinic that offers an effective BMD test, then keep reading.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is the BMD TEST?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The</span><strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/bmd-test-in-pune\"><strong>BMD test in Pune </strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">&nbsp;is also known as the bone mass density test, and it checks the mass in the bone and identifies the amount of calcium in the bone. This also examines the risk of osteoporosis, fracture, osteogenesis imperfecta, and many more. Along with this, there are several other issues for which doctors recommend this test, including the consumption of steroids in the long term, any kind of fracture during sports activities, and other cases.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Who can benefit from this test?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The BMD Test is highly recommended for men and women with ages above 65 or older, including pregnant women. In most cases, a bone density test is needed for people who have persistent pain in the spine and hips, for athletes who have persistent pain in the bones, or for injuries.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Before having this test, make sure to have a discussion with your orthopedic surgeon or orthopedic doctor about whether you need it or not.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>How does the BMD test work?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After hearing the word &quot;test&quot;, you might be thinking about its procedure, and here we are sharing a glimpse of it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The BMD test is painless and requires no medication, so there is no need to be worried about pain and doses.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">In this test, you need to lie on a bed, and the X-ray radiation needs to pass through the body. It will scan the whole body and identify bone health.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">There are generally three types of BMD test procedures that you need to go through: dual-energy, peripheral DXA, and quantitative computed tomography.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This test generally covers the whole body, including the heel, finger, hip, spine, and wrist.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Please note that if you have any kind of issue with your exposure to radiation, tell your doctor before getting this test done.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>BONE DENSITY TEST PRE- and POST-TEST PROCEDURE</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Before and after-test procedures play a vital role in increasing the effectiveness of the test. So if you want to see better results, then you should keep in mind the pre- and post-test procedures.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Pre-test procedure:</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Wear loose and comfortable clothes, and remove all the metal-based accessories.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">If you are consuming any kind of calcium supplement, then inform your doctor about this. Make sure to avoid consumption for about 24 hours.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Inform your doctor if you have any issues regarding the radiation or any kind of treatment recently done.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Post-test procedure:</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Once the test is completed, there is no need to think about other things.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Have patience and think positively regarding the test; you don&rsquo;t need to panic after getting results because your orthopedic doctor is still there for an effective solution.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>What do BMD test results say about your bone health?</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Bones are healthy or have issues like osteoporosis or a lack of nutrients; we can identify all this through the T-score. Here are three types of scores that we consider after the test:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>A T-score (if above -1) means bones are healthy.</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>T-score (if between -1 and -2.5) means osteopenia in bones.</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>T-score (if below -2.5) means osteoporosis in bones.</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">With these scores, doctors can identify the health of bones and the risks associated with them. Always aim to make bones healthy through an enriched diet of protein, vitamins, and calcium, and try to consult with the nutritionist regarding diet tips. Avoid consumption of alcohol, smoking, and stress that degrade the health of bones.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What if you have osteoporosis or issues with bones?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In modern times, the lifestyle of people has changed much more, and people don&rsquo;t have time to take a look at their health. Late-night parties, workaholics, irregular sleep, a lack of knowledge about diet, and the consumption of alcohol all lead to increased bone health issues.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After having a BMD test, if you have been identified with osteoporosis, there is nothing to be worried about. Connect with Dr. Sumitz, an </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>orthopedic clinic in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">. They have been working as orthopedic surgeons in Baner for more than a decade and help bring smiles to the faces of patients. In their clinic, they are well equipped with state-of-the-art machines and an expert team who are ready to take on any challenge and bring back the desired goal.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">So if you have osteoporosis or any kind of bone-related issue, then this clinic is the best place to visit in Pune. Visit the website today to book an appointment and bring out the healthy version of you.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The bone mineral density test is an effective test that diagnoses the health of your bones and the essential nutrients in them. The more your bones are healthy, the more physical activities you can perform in your daily routine. In this blog, we have covered everything about the bone mineral density test, including the process, T-score, risks, pre-and post-test procedures, and the best orthopedic clinic in Pune for a better experience. I hope this guide will help you in every possible manner so you can restore the strength of your bones without any painful surgery. Connect with Dr. Subitz for healthy and enduring bones.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/343765746_14_09_2023_11_18_15.webp','2023-09-14 05:48:15','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(99,'pathology-lab-integrating-science-and-medicine','Pathology Lab: Integrating science and medicine to discover the root cause of ailments ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','The pathology lab is also a field in the medical sector that assists in finding the root cause, nature, and origin of major health issues through lab...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The pathology lab is also a field in the medical sector that assists in finding the root cause, nature, and origin of major health issues through lab tests and research. When state-of-the-art tools and technology and the pathologist&#39;s knowledge are combined, they discover a unique solution to the cause. This whole research needs the cooperation of expert pathologists who work on the cause instead of creating any further issues for the patient.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The word pathology means the study of disease by incorporating medicine and science. There are many clinics out there that offer pathology lab services, along with other healthcare facilities. One of them is Dr. Sumitz, an</span><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">orthopedic and</span><strong> </strong><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-clinic\"><strong>physiotherapy clinic in Baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> that also offers</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/pathology-laboratory\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\"> </span><strong>pathology lab services</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">.</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> The in-house service in the clinic helps to find the root cause of the pain and the type of treatment required for the musculoskeletal system.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this modern era, nothing is impossible, and now the medical sector is also getting advanced through cutting-edge technology. As a result, this eradicates the ailments from the lives of patients and helps them get back to their normal routine. This blog will be a guide to getting comprehensive knowledge about the pathology lab and all about it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is a pathology lab?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The pathology lab is a place where pathologists conduct all the tests and research for a particular disease. The labs in the hospital or clinic are well-equipped with state-of-the-art lab testing tools to diagnose, monitor, and analyze the whole specimen. The pathology is categorized into the following types:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">General pathology</span></li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Anatomical&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Clinical&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Genetics&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Microbiology&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Chemical&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Hematology&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Immunology</span></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">These categories of pathology labs are based on the work performed; there are various kinds of diseases, and that is why, to obtain effective results, this is needed. Ensure that only an MBBS doctor can open a pathology lab, and without a proper license and certificate, no other doctor can open any kind of lab without authorization.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Key Aspects of the Pathology Lab</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In order to bring a healthy future to every individual, the pathology lab plays a pivotal role in meeting health goals. Here we are sharing the vitals and key aspects of the pathology lab. -&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Sample examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The pathologist needs a sample to proceed with the test, and that is why they need specimens of blood, urine, and other fluids in the body. After a sample examination, the pathologist can come to the main conclusion effortlessly and also help in identifying the root cause.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Diagnosis of health issues</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">There are many health issues that exist, but most of the time symptoms seem familiar, but that is not exactly what is meant to be. To identify the exact issue, pathology lab testing is needed. Through the specimens, you can exactly identify the disease and the best practices to get it treated.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Cause-specific therapy</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After proper identification of the disease, the pathologist can guide the doctor regarding the procedures and the health issues. The proper guidance of the pathologist brings the effective result as desired. From rehabilitation to recovery, they guide each thing for the instant healing of the patient.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Cancer Diagnosis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Cancer is a deadly disease, and in order to diagnose the stages of cancer, we need to have proper pathology lab testing to monitor the risk level. This is an effective method to diagnose this issue and to take prompt action towards it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Prioritize the quality</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">For accurate results, pathologists never underestimate the quality and effectiveness of the test. There is a restriction for everyone to enter the premises, and without proper apparel for the testing, no one has a permit to enter. The more you prioritize quality, the better results you will achieve from a particular lab test.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Research and Advancemen</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Whether it is about the pandemic or any other health issue, the whole process of identifying and diagnosing the root cause begins in the pathology lab. Every day, our expert pathologists put their best efforts into reaching the epitome of excellence in medical history. The latest discoveries in medicine, tools, and treatment are a new ray of hope for the paramount achievement in the medical sector.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Qualifications required, and who can run the pathology lab?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Pathology labs require intricate attention to detail in diagnosing, assessing, and examining health issues. This requires skilled hands to perform the whole procedure, and only certified members can even open the lab for their work experience.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Who can run the pathology lab?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Pathologist&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lab technicians&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Pathology lab manager</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Qualification required&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Medical degree (M.D. or D.O.)</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Board certification in pathology</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">4 to 5 years of training in pathology</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">MBBS degree&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">BSc degree in laboratory</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">MSc in pathology</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">License from the Medical Council of India</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are the benefits you will find from visiting the pathology lab in Pune of Dr. Sumit?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Dr.Sumitz Clinic offers the best quality </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/pathology-laboratory\"><strong>pathology lab services in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, and they have extensive years of experience in providing effective healthcare solutions to their patients. With the collaborative efforts of their team, they help the patient bridge the gap between suffering and instant recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Accurate diagnosis</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">With the cooperative effort of the team, state-of-the-art technology and attention to detail help in obtaining an accurate diagnosis.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Effective diagnosis of disease</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">We assure the effective diagnosis of diseases related to any kind of musculoskeletal-related ailments and many others.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Customize treatment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After the examination of proper lab testing, the team and patient sit together and create a proper treatment plan for instant relief.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Timely results</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">After taking a sample of the specimen, our team kept no stone untouched to develop accurate results for the test on time.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Quality tests</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">We prioritize quality, and that&rsquo;s what we promise to our patients. From timely delivery results to accuracy and reliability through tests, we aim for the best in-hand service.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Final thoughts!&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The pathology lab is a cornerstone in the medical sector, setting a benchmark of success in the medical sector through effective lab tests. Today, we are able to identify the root cause of any kind of health complication and are ready to mitigate the risks associated with it. So if you are wondering if you can get any kind of lab test done, then Dr. Sumitz&rsquo;s Pathology Lab in Pune is the best lab where you can conduct a test. This is the best place from which you can begin the journey of a pain-free and healthy life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/661024545_18_01_2024_04_24_13.jpg','2023-09-23 06:34:27','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(100,'knee-replacement-surgery-journey','Knee Replacement Surgery: A Journey from Chronic Knee Pain To A New Normal ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Most of the things we humans often take for granted and one of them is the motions of the body. If you are walking and running and can perform your da...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Most of the things we humans often take for granted and one of them is the motions of the body. If you are walking and running and can perform your daily activities without any discomfort, then you should be grateful.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Lifestyle, irregular diet, and knee-related issues like osteoarthritis eat the bone like termites and eradicate all its potential. This leads to soreness in motion, whether it&rsquo;s playing, walking, or running. Persistent pain in the bone and joint also leads to fractures, and that is why you should not take it for granted.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Expert orthopedic doctors suggest the best alternative for chronic pain in joints, and that is knee replacement surgery. In this procedure, an orthopedic doctor replaces the problem-causing knee with a prosthetic one and positions it in the same place as the original one. This is a 2-3-hour procedure that is performed under the supervision of the medical team and an expert</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\"> </span><strong>orthopedic surgeon</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">. With this procedure, you can again walk and move without any kind of chronic pain or stiffness in your joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Today we are going in-depth about </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/knee-arthritis\"><strong>knee replacement surgery</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">,</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> its procedures, types, cost, recovery process, and the best orthopedic clinic where you can get it done. Keep reading!</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is knee replacement surgery?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">A medical procedure known as knee replacement or knee surfacing involves replacing the damaged knee with an artificial knee. This whole procedure is known as knee arthroplasty. The joint can be affected for multiple reasons, and the main reason for joint replacement surgery is osteoarthritis. Also, if a patient finds stiffness, chronic pain in sitting, walking, or improper mobility of the joint, the doctor recommends having knee replacement surgery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The word &ldquo;knee replacement surgery&rdquo; comes with the nightmare of the patient, and the patient comes across horrific thoughts about the pain and the lifetime bed. So here we are sharing the answer to this question: </span><em>Is knee replacement surgery a severe operation?</em><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> Well, everything has two sides, and knee replacement surgery is the same. The knee replacement is not a complicated surgery, and if done with proper care and the supervision of an expert doctor, it will bring a smooth transition into the patient&#39;s life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Breakdown Myths about Knee Replacement Surgery: Just Facts</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The best age group for knee replacement surgery is 50&ndash;70 years old.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">With the help of physiotherapy, bending and sitting have become easier even after the knee replacement surgery.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">In case any kind of failure in surgery happens, there is a provision for revised surgery for better results.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Knee replacement surgery lasts for a lifetime.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">After fully recovering from this treatment, the patient can perform daily activities with ease.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Procedures for knee replacement surgery</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Before proceeding with the knee replacement surgery, make sure to discuss with a reliable </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\"><strong>orthopedic doctor in pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> the relevance of this treatment in their life. When it comes to the procedure, knee replacement surgery generally occurs in the following ways:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Consultation</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Before this surgery, the orthopedic doctor sits with the patient to get detailed information, like past history and health condition; further testing is ongoing. This will assist in examining the health risks and success rate possibilities of the surgery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Physical examination</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In order to check the body of a patient and the condition of the knee before surgery, the doctor needs to take further physical examinations. The more effective the examination, the better he can identify the knee. This physical examination can be done through X-rays, MRIs, and other screening tests.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Treatment</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Now the next step is to make yourself ready for the final shot of treatment that begins with a replacement. The affected joint part in this case takes the place of a metal component. Then the doctor placed the metal-grade insert spacer to make the knee&rsquo;s surface smooth.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>How long does it take to recover from knee replacement surgery?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Knee replacement surgery is the best alternative for chronic knee pain, but after getting major treatment, your body takes time to adjust to a new tenant in their home. For a patient, this is also the time to have patience and be calm to gain effective results. As per the expert orthopedic doctor, the maximum time it takes to recover from knee replacement surgery is around 4-6 months.</span><a href=\"https://www.popb.md/2021/11/19/knee-replacement-surgery-statistics-you-should-know/#:~:text=About%2090%25%20of%20Knee%20Replacements,of%20the%20new%20knee%20joint.\"><em> </em></a>The survey reveals that the success rate is 95% for knee replacement surgery, and that is why about 90% of knee replacement surgery has been performed in the last 10 years.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">During this period, there are several instant healing and rehabilitation processes being followed to make the patient comfortable with metal elements. Physiotherapy is the best option for rehabilitation and recovery from the surgery. This process improves the mobility and functioning of the joint. However, if an established and reputable </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>orthopedic clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\"> </span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">performs the surgery, then they will assist with sophisticated and extensive recovery plans that achieve the goal of comfort following the surgery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Quicken your recovery time and resume your regular activities</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Also, we are sharing here some tips for the fast recovery of a patient who is undergoing knee replacement surgery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Always follow the advice of your orthopedic surgeon. Never start anything without taking his advice.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Physical therapy is the best alternative for faster recovery, and that is why you should not skip any sessions. For physical therapy-related services, you can connect with us.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The doctor and team&#39;s recommended pain management techniques are the best to use for efficient healing after knee replacement surgery.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Take complete rest, avoid any kind of lifting, and keep a pause on a regular activity for some time.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Stay hydrated, take a balanced diet, quit smoking or drinking, and practice mindfulness to keep yourself in a calm state.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Stay in touch with the orthopedic surgeon and make them aware of your present situation in case you are experiencing any pain or discomfort.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Cost of Knee Replacement Surgery</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">There are many discussions about the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/knee-arthritis\"><strong>cost of knee replacement surgery</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, but the actual fact is that the price depends on various factors, and here are those:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><em>Types of knee replacement: partial and total</em></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><em>Types of hospitals and their facilities</em></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><em>Experience of a doctor</em></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><em>Location&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><em>Charges for almost comprehensive treatments like physical therapy, medication, and anesthesia.</em></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">However, in the current market, the cost of knee replacement surgery is about 1.3 lakh to 1.8 lakh, including pre-and post-treatment procedures.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Highlights of the complications associated with knee replacement surgery</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Knee replacement surgery is a prosthetic surgery that needs to be performed to relieve the pain in the knee. However, the procedure is quite complicated, and metal implantation in the place of the knee brings various distress to the patient. A patient who undergoes this treatment faces the following complications:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Infection&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Blood clot</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Implant problems&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Internal injury&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Delay in recovery</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Excessive pain&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Limited motion&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Proper monitoring and regular dressing of the wound are crucial to preventing major complications.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Final Thoughts!</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Every problem comes with a solution, and here, the chronic knee pain that is still bothering you also has a solution, which is knee replacement surgery. This treatment will bring new life to you and can kickstart a new and healthy journey effortlessly. So if you are ready to get started, then begin with any reliable orthopedic clinic, that has a team of orthopedic experts working with no stone left unturned. Cost-effective, reliable, and the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>best orthopedic clinic in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> to make a smooth transition from chronic knee pain to a new normal. If you or any loved one of yours is suffering from this kind of pain, then this is the time to offer them the gift of a healthy life.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Note - This is just an educational guide and we don&rsquo;t provide Knee Replacement Surgery services. But you can book consultation services for further suggestions.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/147394252_18_01_2024_04_17_34.jpg','2023-09-26 06:24:10','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(101,'cerebral-palsy-day-special-there-is-a-cure-for-cerebral','Cerebral Palsy Day Special: There is a cure for Cerebral Palsy, but almost nobody knows about it','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Cerebral palsy is a brain development issue, and this leads to physical abnormalities in kids. This is a prevalent disease worldwide that occurs in 1...','<p><strong>Cerebral palsy</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is a brain development issue, and this leads to physical abnormalities in kids. This is a prevalent disease worldwide that occurs in 1 in 4 children per 1000 births. The main cause of this disease is brain damage during childbirth. The child born with this kind of abnormality has mobility issues, and their survival is also a question mark.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Kids with this kind of issue are unable to live, eat, or play like normal children and have issues like thinking, vision, swallowing, and communication. Diagnosing this disease early is not possible because this issue occurs during birth. The cure for this disease does not exist, but with the help of physiotherapy and orthopedics, we can enhance their body&rsquo;s strength and mobility.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Expert orthopedics and physiotherapists at the Dr. Sumitz Clinic revealed that treatment with physiotherapy and orthopedics is a boon for patients with cerebral palsy. With the proper exercises and training of the body parts, we can turn their suffering into pleasure. In the age of technology, nothing is impossible; you only need guidance from the right orthopedic and physiotherapists.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Every year, the 6th of October is recognized as Cerebral Palsy Day, and today we are also highlighting this topic in a well-detailed manner and how physiotherapy can help Cerebral Palsy patients live with ease.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/zoWISXGsj8YjLbQWI2MwbHe3HOawEMw1CgMpRbF2GekNvoUnu4fpsHuHOMjH7rEK0t7o3JVBPzORpHwoQ_YDOxKY1yYuPCEA_V6T3oaG3LAGKYJxlJPsQSTmj1pH3YHkbYC6E_JOCdwHuvkrDnhMaHU\" style=\"height:208px; margin-left:0px; margin-top:0px; width:546px\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is the main cause of cerebral palsy?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In the majority of patients, the main cause is still unknown, but it may vary from person to person. Depending upon the patient&rsquo;s history and during pregnancy and birth, most of the things are involved. However, during diagnosis and evaluation, these are some of the main causes of cerebral palsy that are responsible.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Premature birth of a child</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Brain injuries&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lack of oxygen</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Any kind of infection in the CNS</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Heredity issues&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Exposure to alcohol</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Maternal issues&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Delivery-related issue</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Symptoms of Cerebral Palsy</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Diagnosis of major symptoms of cerebral palsy helps to take prompt precautions and connect with the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>orthopedic clinic in pune </strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">and physiotherapist for prompt care.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Stiffness in muscles</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Drooling&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Improper mobility&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Issues with eating and digestion</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Weak muscles</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lack of coordination</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Unable to hear and see properly</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Types of Cerebral Palsy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">There are the following types of cerebral palsy: spastic, dyskinetic, ataxic, hypotonia, and mixed. These types depend on the affected areas of the patient and predominant movement patterns.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Percentage of children and adolescents aged 3 to 17 years with CP&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/c_QEmhiBDgiDk9pJ60LH3DCswpNoU-HKmBr3_Iyte4-m7fsYMGZpq5K9OQEs3CrbAYwdVlABrsNGoQ63gMusfo7xNf2wVj3DUGXXMtILZsf2fNR_YocgliSnf96MfvnV9nDIbjSctAXBlKWU0w3MUhI\" style=\"height:377px; margin-left:0px; margin-top:0px; width:602px\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are the risk factors for cerebral palsy?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Cerebral palsy occurs in kids due to the mother, and here are the following major factors that increase the risk of cerebral palsy in babies:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Complications during birth</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Infections, including STIs and rubella</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Blood type&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Multiple births&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Fetal Growth Restrictions</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Infertility issues</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Maternal heart issues</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Consumption of alcohol and drugs during pregnancy</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Stress and anxiety</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"><img src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/Shku8W1ZD5HgaUhEvCNmV2JRIOgd7cwJzeNxrW3L9pTC1zdpnS8Xd4bsE4QHf9zB3BBVAv_fu7FUxGaFSoM08DaRNDAI--dJXykN4MO-gdDQHr8MFgS_eTbcOLbAhh5UNOrfc5O-1D_c1Zvs6J0Tm6g\" style=\"height:177px; margin-left:0px; margin-top:0px; width:602px\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Physiotherapy&#39;s potential benefits for people with cerebral palsy</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Kids with cerebral palsy have one side of the body that doesn&#39;t function properly like the other. In this situation, proper exercise helps with mobility to some extent. The majority of physiotherapists have changed the lives of cerebral palsy patients through exercises and various modalities.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Physiotherapy is an effective solution for cerebral palsy, and it involves the physical training of the body and encourages mobility and the functioning of parts.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Mobility and motor skills</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The foremost issues for the patient with CP are improper movement and the functioning of the body parts for motion. During the sessions of physiotherapy, the doctors perform movement-related exercises and gait training. This assists the patient in aligning their flexibility, strength, and coordination of the body parts with the mind.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Pain management</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Due to stiffness in the joints, lying on the same side of the bed may cause severe pain for the patient. The doctors use a variety of pain management techniques, like hot and cold therapy, to treat this kind of pain in order to provide the patient with relief. During the motion training of the patient, this pain management technique is also needed to bring ease to life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Assistive devices and mobility aids</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Due to improper coordination of the body and the mind, motion becomes impossible for the patient. That is why doctors use several assistive devices that assist the patient in proper walking, like walkers, crutches, and wheelchairs. These devices are also known as orthotics. Ankle, wrist, and arm braces and heel casts are some of its examples.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Postural Training</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In cerebral palsy, the posture of the body is also not well balanced, like in a normal person. Due to this reason, the doctors provide postural training, where they correct the posture of the body through training or exercises. The right posture enhances the personality of an individual, aids in digestion and breathing, and prevents the body parts from experiencing pain. This session includes ergonomics, where the experts talk about sitting posture.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Speech and swallowing therap</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Generally, the patients with cerebral palsy are kids or children, and ill-matured children are unable to speak or swallow at this stage. To make them speak, eat, and take the right action, the physiotherapist plans the session for them. Oral motor activities and breathing are some of the therapies that help them in every possible manner.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Enhance motor function</strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Doctors perform for the patients a few exercises or activities to make their brains understand the movement patterns and muscles needed to get done with daily activities. Consistent practice ensures the brain functions properly and brings the body into the desired motion.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><strong>Education </strong></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Along with the practice and exercises, proper education is also required for the patient to understand the essence of training. Also, identify the root cause of the problem and the best possible rehabilitation program required for the recovery. The more patients who are educated, the more opportunities there will be for recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>From where can we get physiotherapy services in Pune?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If you belong to a beautiful place like Pune and want to get physiotherapy services, then Dr. Sumitz is the best orthopedic and </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-clinic\"><strong>physiotherapy baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">. With a team of skilled doctors and a well-equipped clinic, we offer reliable and effective health services at a cost-effective price.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">For patients with cerebral palsy, it is a challenge to live and survive with abnormalities, but still, the physiotherapist and orthopedic surgeon left no stone unturned to make the situation better or worse. So if your child has any issue with movement or stiffness in bones, then you are most welcome to the clinic of Dr. Sumitz.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>FINAL thoughts</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Cerebral palsy occurs mostly in 1 in 4 children per 1000 births, but this disease still captures major attention due to its complications. The children also don&rsquo;t survive longer, and they can&rsquo;t even live like others. With the help of physiotherapy and orthopedics, at least we can help them stand on their feet. Physiotherapy involves exercises and training to reduce pain, bring motion to joints, and much more. Orthopedics helps improve the structure of bones and add strength and resilience. For these patients, both work like magic wands, but the patient needs patience for results and recovery. In order to get more assistance with this issue, you can connect with us.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Read more about cerebral palsy here.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/cerebral-palsy-improving-functional-mobility-by-physical-therapy\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">https://www.drsumitz.com/blogs/cerebral-palsy-improving-functional-mobility-by-physical-therapy</span></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/978016449_18_01_2024_04_15_13.jpg','2023-10-07 07:12:21','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(102,'how-do-i-know-if-i-have-rheumatoid-arthritis','How do I know if I have Rheumatoid arthritis? ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Rheumatoid arthritis is an autoimmune disorder, and it is a prevalent disease that is popular worldwide. But the cure is possible if you have the guid...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Rheumatoid arthritis is an autoimmune disorder, and it is a prevalent disease that is popular worldwide. But the cure is possible if you have the guidance and assistance of the best </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\"><strong>orthopedic doctor in baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">. Also, occupational and physiotherapy is another treatment that will be a lifesaver for the patient. This treatment can only be effective when you are diagnosed early in an alarming situation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this blog, we have discussed the symptoms, causes, and early signs of rheumatoid arthritis. This guide will be a great help for the patient, and you will prevent your life from being put at risk.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Alarming situation of arthritis&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><img src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/67mGLRr174wBTMAGenq9pBeCHsRh6erZQgto9GFhewP3ayErq7qaKCeMFM54a8RpEbtpBQAAqsW2rlItxvP6cCPeCFap15itgldw80Jwns-EmmDNnfEjeNk7lNvy5V57ZXDO6Uh7y7fIebTn5V317B4\" style=\"height:304px; margin-left:0px; margin-top:0px; width:592px\" /></span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is Rheumatoid arthritis?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Rheumatoid arthritis, or RA, is also considered a type of arthritis, and it is an autoimmune disorder. In this issue, the immune system unknowingly attacks parts of the body, and this process weakens the foundational bones of the body. This is a chronic health issue that can occur in people of any age. In this issue, the patient suffers from fever, swelling in joints and pain, joint stiffness, and loss of appetite.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The fact is that this disease is not curable, and that is why it is important to be diagnosed early before it is too late. For orthopedic doctors, this is a challenge, but they have multiple alternative treatment methods to cure this bone health issue if diagnosed early.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are the main causes of rheumatoid arthritis?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As per the orthopedic doctors, the exact main causes of rheumatoid arthritis are not predictable and are still under research. But in the majority of cases, when it comes to the doctor, these are the main causes that patients refer to:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Genetics&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Hormones</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lifestyle factors&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Obesity&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Previous bone-health issues like osteoarthritis</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">90% of the health-related problems occur due to genetic or heredity factors. Rheumatoid arthritis is one of them.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The fluctuation in hormones is another factor that may cause rheumatoid arthritis. Hormone fluctuation can occur due to medication, food habits, and improper sleep.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">untimely sleep, overload of work, long hours sitting in the same place, consumption of alcohol or smoke, and irregular diet</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Maintaining a healthy weight is a necessary factor in reducing health-related issues because it creates adverse effects on the bones.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">The patient who is suffering from bone health issues before, especially osteoarthritis, can also experience this issue.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are the early signs of rheumatoid arthritis?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Here are the early signs of rheumatoid arthritis that you should not ignore:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint stiffness and pain: persistent pain, swelling, and starting from small joints</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Symmetrical swelling, pain, and tenderness in the bones and joints</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Feeling lethargic all the time</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Sense of lost strength and weakness in the bones and joints</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Incompetent at performing even daily activities limits the motion.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Pain in the bones and joints, especially during the morning</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Rheumatoid nodules are a kind of lump under the skin and generally occur around the affected parts of the body.</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Fever, loss of appetite, flu-like symptoms, and dryness or discomfort in the eyes</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If you may experience these early signs, then you should consult with an orthopedic doctor to cure this issue before it becomes severe.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are the stages of rheumatoid arthritis?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Rheumatoid arthritis has the following stages, and every stage is created based on the symptoms and complications.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>First stage&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">During the first stage, the patient will experience the following symptoms or complications:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Pain in smaller bones or joints like fingers, wrists, and toes</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Mild joint pain and stiffness</span></li>\r\n	<li><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Fatigue&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Moderate stage</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In the moderate stage, the patient may have the following issues:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Frequent joint inflammation</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Morning stiffness in joints</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Swelling, warmth, and tenderness</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint erosion or narrow space of joint</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Severe Stage</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In the severe stage, here are the following signs or symptoms that occur:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Joint damage or loss of function</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Chronic inflammation in joints</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Loss of mobility function in joints</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Rheumatoid nodules in the skin</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Persistent pain&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>End stage&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">This is an advanced rheumatoid arthritis stage, and the following symptoms occur in the patient:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Extreme joint pain</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Lose mobility</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Use of assistive devices for motion, like wheelchairs and walkers</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Long-term inflammation</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Damage to bones, like osteoporosis</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In the last stage, the patient is incompetent to walk, move, or run and can&rsquo;t even perform daily activities. This is a severe stage and affects the quality of life of the patient, putting every task to a halt.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>At what age does rheumatoid arthritis start?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Rheumatoid arthritis generally occurs in middle age and may also happen in childhood. There are two categories of rheumatoid arthritis based on age: YORA means young-onset rheumatoid arthritis, and LORA means long-onset rheumatoid arthritis. The doctor suggests this arthritis occurs between 30 and 60 years of age. That is why it is recommended to maintain a healthy lifestyle to prevent bone-related issues at such an early age.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What should you do when you are diagnosed with rheumatoid arthritis?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If you have been diagnosed with rheumatoid arthritis, then here are the steps that you should take:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Consult with a doctor</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The foremost thing that you need to do is consult with an expert orthopaedic doctor and take the necessary steps to put a halt to rheumatoid arthritis. Every expert doctor knows how to deal with the situation for a patient of every particular age and symptom.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Make recommended changes to your lifestyle</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Lifestyle is a major factor that increases health-related issues. Certain lifestyle factors, like eating habits and daily task-related activities, need to be changed. Take consultation calls with the expert nutritionist and follow their advice sincerely.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Go for medical tests</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The medical test helps to get detailed insight into the actual bone health situation. In every stage, these tests play an important role in taking the necessary steps. X-rays, blood tests, ultrasounds, MRIs, and</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/bmd-test-in-pune\"><strong> </strong><strong>BMD test in pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Take symptoms seriously</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">For every patient, every minor sign is a signal of a major health risk. That is why you should inform your orthopedic patient of any experienced symptoms.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>Attend all physiotherapy appointments</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this issue, physiotherapy is an effective treatment for the patient. This can be a lifesaver, so you shouldn&rsquo;t skip any physiotherapy sessions. Joint mobility, pain management, posture mechanics, functional and strength training, and prevent any kind of disability in patients.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Final thoughts!</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Rheumatoid arthritis is a chronic inflammation disorder that affects well-being. For patients, it is necessary to stay informed and educated about this health issue. Lifestyle habits, past bone health issues, and obesity are the major causes of rheumatoid arthritis. But with the assistance of an expert </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\"><strong>orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">, you can prevent yourself from reaching this severe stage. So if you are someone who is suffering from this type of arthritis, then </span><strong>Dr. Sumitz</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is the best</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong> orthopedic clinic in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> to connect with.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/632845435_18_01_2024_04_14_16.jpg','2023-10-13 06:56:43','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(103,'joint-popping-sound-is-this-sound-an-indication-of-a-serious-joint-problem','Joint popping sound - Is this sound an indication of a serious joint problem? Explained in detail','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Bones and joints are the foundation of our whole body, and when they work in parallel, it helps to perform daily activities. Have you ever heard a joi...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Bones and joints are the foundation of our whole body, and when they work in parallel, it helps to perform daily activities. Have you ever heard a joint-popping sound from your bones while playing or performing any kind of activity? Also, it is a habit of the majority of men and women to crack their fingers in any kind of nervous situation. If yes, then you are not alone.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Joint popping is a familiar situation that occurs to men and women. As per the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/orthopaedic-treatment\"><strong>orthopedic in baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> expert, the popping sound may occur due to physical reasons or sometimes intentionally. Individuals who are sitting in an interview room are more likely to crack their knuckles due to nervousness. On the other hand, arthritis, gas bubbles, injury, and synovial cysts are some of the reasons that are responsible for causing joint popping sounds.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">This is normal, and there is nothing to be afraid of if it doesn&rsquo;t leave you with pain, swelling, or any kind of inflammation. What if it causes pain? In this blog, we are going to give you in-depth details about this kind of situation and what to do if this condition bothers you.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Why does a joint-popping sound occur?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Below, we have listed the reasons why the joint popping sound occurs:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Escaping gases</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The synovial fluid is a familiar cause of snapping in joints. As the joints manipulate one another, the fluid contains gases like nitrogen and oxygen that form bubbles. This generally occurs in the fingers, knuckles, and spine.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Muscle tightness and weakness</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Muscle weakness and tightness can occur due to various reasons, like stiffness and a deficiency of vitamins, proteins, and iron. As a result, these issues in bones and joints also cause popping sounds.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Movement of the tendon and ligament</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">During the movement of the tendon and ligament, like when they slightly shift from their position and return to the same place, this kind of popping sound occurs. Knees, ankles, and shoulders are the major regions where you can hear.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Arthritis</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">People with arthritis are familiar with this kind of sound, as it indicates inflammation and irregularities in the joints. Knees, hips, and spines are the common regions where arthritis patients notice this sound.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Age and wear</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As we age, the strength, lubricant, and smoothness of our joints fade over time, which causes wear and tear. The loss of cartilage and rough surfaces when it comes to other bones causes this sound to occur.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Injury</strong></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Bone injuries like a torn meniscus, cartilage loss, lateral collateral ligament, PCL, and MCL injuries are the reasons that cause popping sounds.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Is it normal for your joints to make a popping sound?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As per orthopedic experts, the popping sound in joints is common in individuals unless it doesn&rsquo;t cause any kind of pain, swelling, or any kind of discomfort in the mobility of joints. This popping sound can be made intentionally, like cracking fingers, bending their fingers, or sudden movements of tendons, ligaments, and tissues.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">But if you are concerned about this situation, then you can connect with the best orthopedic or chiropractic expert who will evaluate the whole situation and give you genuine results.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What vitamin deficiency causes popping sounds in joints?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The diet you consume plays an important role in shedding off the strength or making it robust all life long. For any activity, our body needs strength, and it comes from the type of platter you choose. A platter that contains the proper amount of calcium, proteins, carbs, and vitamins is an everyday need to bring a body into proper shape. Also, it is essential to maintain the strength of our bones and joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">When the bones start producing an echo sound during any kind of movement, it also indicates the deficiencies of the following vitamins: vitamin K, vitamin D, vitamin C, vitamin B12, and sometimes dehydration.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>At what age do joints start popping?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The popping of sound can occur to people of any age. As we have learned, one of the main causes of bone popping is the development of gas bubbles in synovial fluid, so this can occur at any time. The age is not defined for this issue, and hence it can occur to children, adults, and older people of any age.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Observe the change in the pain and the type of pain or inflammation, and when you find it painful or not tolerable, you can connect with the orthopedic expert to avoid any kind of future complications.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Treatments that are helpful to bid farewell to painful joint popping sounds</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">What if the popping sound causes pain? If this situation persists for a long time and also affects your daily working routine, then, immediately, you should get the following treatments to get relief from this situation:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Physical therapy&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Strengthening exercises</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Range of motion exercises</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Warm up before exercises or workouts.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Anti-inflammatory medications&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Use assistive devices or ergonomic tools.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Heat or cold therapy</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Weight management&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Surgery&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The painful joint popping is a symptom that you should not take for granted in any manner. Consult with an</span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><strong> </strong><strong>orthopaedic surgeon in baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> and get it treated promptly, because as long as you suffer, there will be more chances that it can worsen the situation of bones and joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">A </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-clinic\"><strong>physiotherapy baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> is one solution for all bone and joint-related issues, and it enhances flexibility and mobility.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Final Thoughts!</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Joint popping is a prevalent issue that occurs to men and women of any age. This issue is normal unless it doesn&rsquo;t create any kind of pain. This issue occurs due to the following reasons: lack of vitamins, gas bubbles, age, wear and tear, arthritis, and many more. In the blog, you will find all the reasons that cause pop sounds in joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">To eliminate this issue, physiotherapy is the best healing therapy that can help you not suffer for long if immediate action has been taken. So if you are someone who wants to get this issue resolved, then Dr. Sumitz Clinic is the best </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>orthopedic clinic in pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> and is ready to assist you with a competent team and high-end equipment. Bestow your life with smooth and healthy bones and joints to take every step of life forward without any barriers.</span></p>\r\n','uploads/product/455626595_18_01_2024_04_12_59.jpg','2023-10-27 12:27:24','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(104,'physiotherapy-or-occupational-therapy','Physiotherapy or occupational therapy - Which one is right for you? ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Physiotherapy and occupational therapy are both different kinds of therapies, and they improve the quality of health. In order to cherish every moment...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Physiotherapy and occupational therapy are both different kinds of therapies, and they improve the quality of health. In order to cherish every moment in life, individuals need to take assistance from such therapies to eliminate pain and welcome good health and well-being. For people of all ages, this is effective because the main aim of the therapy is to bring mobility, enhance function, and increase flexibility in the body to perform the daily tasks in an effective manner.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this blog, we will discuss physiotherapy and occupational therapy, how they are different, and which one is better from one to another. So if you want to know more about these therapy treatments, then keep reading.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are physiotherapy and occupational therapy?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-treatment\"><strong>physiotherapy treatment in pune</strong></a><strong> </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">or physical therapy, generally helps an individual with mobility, functioning, and reducing pain after surgery. This is a highly effective treatment procedure that restores strength. Physiotherapists take concern for the past situation, examine the whole health-related issue, and then prescribe the exercise routine. There are sessions for every patient with every medical condition, as recommended by every doctor or expert.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Occupational therapy, or OT, is a kind of therapy that helps people perform daily tasks effortlessly. People who are involved in sports or physical activity and have trouble performing the tasks can choose occupational therapy for a better experience.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is the difference between occupational therapy and physiotherapy?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In both of the therapies, one thing is common: both work for the patient&rsquo;s better health experience and don&rsquo;t allow the patient to face failure in achieving the health goals.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Physiotherapy&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-clinic\"><strong>physiotherapy clinic in pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> generally helps to improve physical ability, reduce pain, and avoid any kind of disability.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This is needed to recover from the persistent pain from surgeries and mainly focuses on ergonomics, joint or muscle pain, stiffness, and adding flexibility.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Educate the patients about the best posture, how to do exercises, and pain management techniques.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Physiotherapy is needed for prompt recovery after a heart attack or heart failure.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This therapy involves electrical stimulation, modalities, stretches, joint mobilization, coordination, ultrasound therapy, neurological disorders, and </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/back-and-neck-pain\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(17, 85, 204)\">back pain treatment baner</span></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Physiotherapy treatment practices involve:</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Assessment and evaluation</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In physiotherapy, the doctor first assesses the situation and then determines the best possible exercises to restore the healthy days.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Therapeutic exercises</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">To improve strength, flexibility, endurance, and coordination, they target specific body parts and start engaging in exercises.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Modalities</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">For pain management, inflammation, and healing, they bring these activities into action to avoid suffering.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Gait training</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Gait training involves training the patient to walk in a smooth manner and maintain balance in walking and daily task-based activities.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Balance and coordination</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Every step you take involves your brain and neurons, and then only you can balance the whole body and be able to coordinate what you need one after the other.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Home exercise programs</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">If a patient is unable to walk daily to the clinic, then physiotherapists visit them directly at home to complete the procedures.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Occupational Therapy&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Occupational therapy brings independence to performing daily tasks, including walking, playing, and working.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This is a basic therapy for people of all ages and most essential for sportspeople.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">They worked with patients who had physical, mental, cognitive, and developmental disorders.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Due to autism, stroke, brain and traumatic injuries, and arthritis, if any patient is suffering, then give proper assistance for a better experience.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">This kind of therapy involves adaptive equipment, assistive technology, environmental conditions, and a set of particular exercises.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Success rate of OCCUPATIONAL THERAPY&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"width:451.27559055118115pt\">\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"vertical-align:top\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"color:rgb(33, 33, 33)\">The database contained a total of 201 consecutive clients referred to the clinic for occupational rehabilitation services. Of these clients, 95 were identified as receiving their first episode of care in the general occupational rehabilitation program, and 71 were identified as entering the comprehensive occupational rehabilitation program for the first time.</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n	</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Occupational therapy practices involve:</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>ADL Training</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this training, the therapist helps the patient find freedom in performing daily activities. For example, bathing, dressing, and performing any kind of task</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Fine motor skills training</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Fine motor skills training helps to align the coordination between the organs of the body and the brain and brings ease to performing tasks.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Sensory integration activities</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">This kind of activity helps the patient regulate the senses and improves the action-taking decision towards any activity.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Workplace or school evaluation</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Therapists need to evaluate the workplace or school environment to improve effectiveness in daily activities and ergonomics.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Assistive technology training</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In this training, the therapist tries to make the patient adept at using assistive devices so that it won&rsquo;t create any trouble for disabled patients. Speech recognition, wheelchairs, and walkers are the best examples of assistive devices. To bring comfort and ease to performing these activities, new advanced tools are also developing, and through this training, patients can also learn about them.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:#000000\"><strong>Cognitive rehabilitation</strong></span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Cognitive rehabilitation helps the neuropatients improve their memory, attention, problem-solving, and functioning skills.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Physiotherapy vs. Occupational Therapy: Here is how they are different&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Physiotherapy and occupational therapy involve different patients, and their techniques, procedures, and target patients are different, but it is not worth saying that you should give priority to only one at a time.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Here is how they are different:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Physiotherapy is required for physical impairment issues, musculoskeletal issues, and neurological rehabilitation.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Occupational therapy is needed to bring independence in performing daily activities, for cognitive-based issues, and for pediatric and child development issues.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The one thing that makes occupational therapy different from physiotherapy is that it is required mostly for disabled people, pediatric patients, and mentally disabled patients. This therapy is also effective for children with any kind of mental development disorder.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>How can I find out which therapy I should choose for better results?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Here are the ways in which you can find the best-suited therapy for yourself:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Consult with physicians and healthcare professionals.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Nature of the health issues, like stiffness in joints or a decreased range of motion</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Determine the goals that you want to achieve from the treatment.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Examine the time in recovery in order to achieve results.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Check availability and accessibility.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Ensure that you don&rsquo;t start any kind of therapy without consultation from expert physicians. It is important to get clarity about the treatment as per the health issues and choose a reliable clinic to meet those needs.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Final thoughts!</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">In modern life, we can&rsquo;t stop ourselves due to any kind of pain and suffering, and that is why we always try to get therapy or treatment that can bring us back to a normal life. Occupational therapy and physiotherapy are renowned therapies in the medical industry and are also different from one another. Occupational therapy is specialized for disabled patients or people who have cognitive disabilities. On the other hand, physiotherapy is specialized in improving the mobility and functioning of the joints and in providing rehabilitation after surgeries.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Once you understand the purpose of these therapies, you will never spend time, effort, or money on the wrong procedures. Also, never forget to consider a reliable clinic if you are looking for better results.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/890692893_18_01_2024_04_11_16.jpg','2023-10-30 06:04:33','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(105,'according-to-a-report-60-of-people-prefer-nutritional-guidance-to-adopt-healthier-habits-are-you-one-of-them','According to a report, 60% of people prefer nutritional guidance to adopt healthier habits. Are you one of them?','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','If you are getting a platter of complete nutrients, a proper 8 hours of sleep, and a sound mind, then you are a rich man. Nothing in this world is mor...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">If you are getting a platter of complete nutrients, a proper 8 hours of sleep, and a sound mind, then you are a rich man. Nothing in this world is more precious than a healthy and sound body. Daily, we need to hustle hard to accumulate the materialistic resources to create a luxury life. For this reason, we need to bring equilibrium to nutrition and daily activity to produce better outputs.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">When nutrition enters the body, it performs a </span><strong>chemical</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> reaction that breaks down into the form of energy. Both our inner cells and our bones require this energy to carry out daily tasks without feeling lethargic. In this present era, awareness of health and nutrition is needed to live life to the fullest. The </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/nutrition-dietitian\"><strong>nutritionist at Baner</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> of </span><strong>Dr.Sumitz Clinic</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\"> predicts that the great motivator in food choices is flavor. Gen-Z accepts or eliminates the particular diet from their platter through its flavor.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">But this kind of habit allows people to consume loads of fast foods and an untimely diet and also opens doors for several diseases that make them unfit to lead a game. In this blog, we are going to give you a brief description of nutrition and how you can achieve optimal health and wellness.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What is the difference between nutrition and diet?&nbsp;</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">Did you know about the difference between nutrition and diet? Well, let us help you understand the whole concept. For example, when an individual consumes food that contains carbohydrates, fats, vitamins, proteins, and roughage, the food follows particular procedures like absorption, digestion, and utilization of the energy by each and every part of the body for proper functioning.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The outcome we achieve after digestion, absorption, and utilization of the food, like energy, is the nutrition that comes through the processes. On the other hand, the diet includes carbohydrates, proteins, fats, and vitamins that are found in particular vegetables, fruits, and whole grains.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Why is a nutritional diet important?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">The changing lifestyle is a distressing factor that leads to obesity, introduces severe diseases into life, and promotes a non-active lifestyle. To bring life into the right phase, it is necessary to balance the composition of the diet and make effective changes based on complications like pre- and post-surgery, as per the expert nutritionist. Here is why we need a proper </span><strong>nutrition </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">and diet plan in our daily lives:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Promotes growth and development</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Provides energy&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Fosters functions of the body</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Avoid any kind of deficiency in nutrition.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">It helps with weight management.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Eliminates the risk of health complications</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Boost immunity&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Improves mental health</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Promotes healthy aging</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(37, 37, 37)\">As per the study performed by experts, gut health is linked to the well-being of an individual, and hence, it is crucial to consume a balanced diet that is easy to digest and aids in making gut health effective.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>What are the seven types of nutrition?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Once you know the importance of nutrition in the body, the question arises about the types of nutrition that a human body needs. The types of nutrition depend on the type of diet we consume daily and their breakdown process. Below, we are sharing the types of nutrition that you need to know:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Macronutrients&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Micronutrients&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Water&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Prebiotics&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Probiotics&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Dietary fiber&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">Antioxidants&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Along with these types of nutrition, there are more as well: carbohydrates, proteins, fats, vitamins, and minerals.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Macronutrients</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The term &ldquo;macro&rdquo; defines its quantity in the body, and macronutrients like carbohydrates, fats, and proteins in the body are needed in much larger amounts.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Micronutrients&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The term &ldquo;micro&rdquo; means it is needed in the body in a smaller quantity and includes vitamins and minerals.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Water&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Water plays an important role in meeting the end goals of almost every process, including digestion, absorption, circulation, and temperature regulation. The quantity of water in our body is 60%, and it acts as a lubricant and eliminates the toxins and harmful elements in the body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Dietary fiber&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The dietary fiber in the body aids in bowel movements, weight loss, and digestion. This is a perfect addition to nutrition and lowers the risk of diseases by eliminating toxins.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Antioxidants </strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Antioxidants are the compounds that nullify the effects of harmful radicals in the body. The antioxidants create a shield of protection and make the defense mechanism strong enough to protect the whole body.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>How many nutrients are required by a particular human in a day?</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\">Did you know how much nutrition your body demands from you? If not, then this chart will help you understand the types of nutrients, their role in the human body, the proportions needed, and the sources.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<table>\r\n	<tbody>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:bottom\">\r\n			<p><strong>Nutrient</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:bottom\">\r\n			<p><strong>Role in the Body</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:bottom\">\r\n			<p><strong>Sources</strong></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Carbohydrates</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Primary energy source; essential for brain function</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">( quantity should be 325 and 225 grams in a day )&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Whole grains, fruits, vegetables, and legumes</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Proteins</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Building and repairing tissues; enzyme functions</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">( quantity should be 50 and 175 grams in a day )</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Meat, fish, poultry, eggs, dairy, and legumes</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Fats</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Energy storage; cell membrane structure</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">( quantity should be approx 44 to 78 grams in a day.)&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Avocado, nuts, seeds, olive oil, and fatty fish</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Vitamins</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Various roles, including immune support, energy production, and maintaining healthy skin and vision</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">( can&rsquo;t define quantity because there are different types of vitamins are there )&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Fruits, vegetables, dairy, whole grains, fish, and meats</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n		</tr>\r\n		<tr>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Minerals</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Bone health, fluid balance, and nerve function</span></p>\r\n\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">( can&rsquo;t define quantity because there are different types of minerals.)&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\n			<td style=\"background-color:#f7f7f8; vertical-align:middle\">\r\n			<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(55, 65, 81)\">Dairy, leafy greens, nuts, seeds, and whole grains</span></p>\r\n			</td>\r\