th but also in a better quality of life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/751160564_16_08_2024_09_01_59.jpg','2024-08-16 15:31:59','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(133,'how-to-choose-the-right-orthopaedic-specialist-for-your-needs','How to Choose the Right Orthopaedic Specialist for Your Needs','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Choosing the right orthopedic specialist can make a big difference in the treatment plans for sports injuries, arthritis, spinal issues, or injury due...','<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Choosing the right </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><strong>orthopedic specialist</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\"> can make a big difference in the treatment plans for sports injuries, arthritis, spinal issues, or injury due to an accident. If you are in Pune, then Dr.SumitZ stands out as a leading orthopedic clinic, offering great orthopedic and physiotherapy care. The well-established procedures for in-home care enables the delivery of excellent patient care. In this blog, we will delve into different specialties, treatment plans, and particulars of orthopedics.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Different specialties of orthopedics</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Orthopedic specialists </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">can specialize in performing procedures on certain body areas to fix or rectify injuries. Some of them are listed below:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Hand: Using physical techniques like exercise, splinting, and wound care are all part of hand treatment. Hand surgery involves various operations on the wrist, hand, and upper limb peripheral nerves. Reconstructive surgery that helps upper limb function is also covered under this.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Knee: Depending on the disease, a knee may require a variety of procedures, including replacement or ligament surgery. The duration of time it takes the patient to recover from ongoing surgery can change according to requirements.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Hip: Patients may go for a lot of hip procedures depending on need. One famous procedure is a hip replacement, in which a metal or ceramic prosthesis is used to replace an arthritis-damaged hip joint. It can take three hours or longer to do this surgery.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Foot and Ankle: An expert at Dr.SumitZ can treat anything from Achilles tendon ruptures to ankle arthritis and fractures. The extent of the injury will determine if surgery is needed or not. Also, a surgeon can make one or more incisions around the ankle joint and use plates and screws to treat an ankle fracture.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Spine: Neurosurgeons, who specialize in the portions of operations involving the nerves and spinal cord, frequently collaborate closely with orthopedic spine surgeons. They can be operating to remove tumors or treat infections.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Shoulder and Elbow: There are several potential reasons for shoulder discomfort, so getting the right diagnosis is crucial to a patient&#39;s healing. The patient may need elbow and/or shoulder surgery, such as rotator cuff repair surgery for the shoulder, depending on the underlying cause.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Particulars to Look for in an Orthopedic Specialist</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Experience and Credentials: It suggests that the </span><strong>orthopedic specialist </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">possesses the required education, expertise, and experience. Consider the specialist&#39;s experience with complicated situations as well, especially if they involve spine and joint replacements.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Clinic Quality: </span><strong>Orthopaedic specialists</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"> at the Dr. SumitZ clinic carefully assess and diagnose patients, providing a personalized treatment plan that the patient must adhere to.&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Communication essentials: Select a professional who carefully listens and is open to your inquiries. Effective treatment depends on the patient-doctor relationship being strong.&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Different treatment plans given by orthopedic doctor near me in Baner</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">General Physical Therapy: Physiotherapy services can be given in addition to prevailing ones, instead of, or in conjunction with primary care at Dr. SumitZ&#39;s clinic. General physical therapy appointments are much easier to make than in the past. Our individualized treatments give patients the tools they require to regain control of their health.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Physical Therapy after surgeries: The experienced staff at Dr.SumitZ, the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\"><strong>best orthopedic doctor in Pune </strong></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">helps patients and their families at every step in recovering from several surgeries and moving back into their routine life.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Ergonomics: As the musculoskeletal system is impacted when you work in an different position, in extremely hot or cold conditions, or through repetitive motions, ergonomics is crucial.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Knee Arthritis: The experts at Dr.SumitZ, </span><strong>Pune&#39;s best orthopedic doctor </strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">help in releasing the symptoms of knee arthritis as it can lead to major complications in later life.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Sports Injuries: Nearly all athletes will experience some kind of injury at some point in their athletic careers. Having a strategy in place for handling obstacles can help the healing process go about faster.</span><br />\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">Fractures: Usually, a person&#39;s bones weaken throughout their late adult years. Their chance of breaking a bone is increased by this.</span></p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">The majority of fractures can be healed by the natural mechanism of the body, but in most cases, shattered bones are put in place through surgeries.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conclusion</strong><br />\r\n&nbsp;</h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Taking care of your bones is very crucial in life, no matter what stage of life you are in. You give yourself the power to take control of your bone health by identifying potential problems like osteoporosis and coming to us for professional advice as the </span><strong>top orthopedic doctor in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">. Proactive measures taken by the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><strong>best orthopedic specialist near me</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\"> in Baner are critical in lowering the chance of spinal disorders and maintaining long-term bone health. Look for the </span><strong>orthopedics specialist near me in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\"> and get all the recoveries on time.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">FAQS</span></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Q1. Do I require surgery for a fractured bone?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Ans. It depends on the type of fracture that you have encountered with, major bone fractures usually need surgeries. Minor ones can treated with casts within one and a half months.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Q2. Are physical therapies essential after surgeries?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Ans. Yes, physical therapies by </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-surgeon\"><strong>Orthopaedics Specialist</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\"> are required to help the ligaments and bone to return in the normal position with good mobility.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Q3. What is arthritis?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255); color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Ans. Arthritis refers to inflammation in joints which can lead to swelling and stiffness in joints.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/162141892_06_09_2024_04_43_59.jpg','2024-09-06 11:14:00','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(134,'understanding-the-benefits-to-jogging-how-it-enhances-your-overall-wellbeing','Understanding the Benefits to Jogging: How It Enhances Your Overall Wellbeing','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Jogging is an effective form of exercise that offers great mental and physical well-being. It is invaluable in the extended run and will let you get a...','<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Jogging is an effective form of exercise that offers great mental and physical well-being. It is invaluable in the extended run and will let you get a free and happy mindset too. Once, you start jogging, your heart will start pumping faster. Hence, continuing it will release endorphins in the body which will act as stimulant. Now you must be wondering, &lsquo;How many kilometers one should run to get such benefits?&rsquo;. Well, you will get all your answers in this blog. In this blog, you will delve into the different</span><strong> <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\">benefits to jogging</a></strong><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\"> and how to get started with it.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Health benefits of jogging</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Good heart health: Jogging is a fantastic cardiovascular workout that keeps your heart healthy. It helps prevent infections and heart problems. Jogging makes sure that blood gets to the heart more quickly, which increases the load on the circulatory system.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Healthy mind: Jogging is assumed to play a major role in enhancing one&#39;s emotional health. Your body releases endorphins after a run, which are feel-good, uplifted hormones that make you feel good about yourself.&nbsp;</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Improves Bone Strength: One of the <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>benefits of jogging in the morning</strong></a> is maintaining bone health. The strain and stress that come with starting to run are experienced by the bones. Jogging builds the bones&#39; ability to withstand the increased strain, which it starts to bear over time. Jogging strengthens bones and prevents fractures and cuts.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Strong immune system: Jogging promotes both emotional and physical well-being. It strengthens your mental fortitude and aids in overcoming suffering and depression. It develops general immunity by getting rid of weariness and increasing the body&#39;s production of white platelets.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Increased productivity: Regular exercisers at work are more productive and have more energy than their less active colleagues. So, jogging enhances your daily work and keeps you ahead of your colleagues.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Prevents infections: Jogging is believed to stimulate the production of macrophages and lymphocytes, which fight against illnesses and viruses that infiltrate our bodies. It aids in the defense against bacterial infections as well as viral infections like the flu and the common cold.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p>Boosts respiratory system: Jogging strengthens the respiratory system&#39;s muscles and increases lung capacity. This guarantees that the lungs efficiently expel carbon dioxide and absorb more oxygen. Jogging, thus, strengthens the respiratory muscles&#39; endurance.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Run Towards a Better Life with Power</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Realistic and specific goals should be set for getting </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>benefits of jogging</strong></a><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">. Start with jogging for just 30 minutes which can help you feel better. Then, slowly you can increase the time depending upon your body. You can talk with an orthopedic doctor before making a jogging plan if you have any medical condition. Dr.SumitZ is the leading orthopedic clinic in Pune that provides high-quality patient care. The condition of the patient determines the planning of multidisciplinary therapy. Instead of following rigid guidelines, treatments are administered according to the needs of the patient.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Jogging can improve your entire quality of life by strengthening social ties, cardiovascular health, mental wellness, and self-esteem. Stay hydrated while going for a walk and make sure you take the specific diet so that you don&rsquo;t shed important calories from the body. An inactive lifestyle may lead to different health problems and may lead to reduced quality of life. Boost your self-confidence by performing better than others and then maintaining </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/\"><strong>benefits of jogging</strong></a><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\"> through different stages in life.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>FAQS</strong></h2>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Q1. Does continuos jogging helps in reducing weight?</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Ans. Yes, it can help to reduce weight. But it needs a lot of plan and timing according to the requirements of the body. All it takes to lose weight is to burn more calories than you take in over an extended period.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Q2. What about the type of shoes one should wear before going for jogging?</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Ans. If at all possible, visit a real running shoe store and consult with experts who can watch you run and determine whether you are a neutral, over-pronator, or supinator.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Q3. What about post-run nutrition?</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"color:rgb(31, 31, 31)\">Ans. You can take chocolate milk and a healthy breakfast with nuts and berries. You can also have a base of mixed salad greens, then top with crumbled goat cheese and one peeled and cubed cooked beet. Focus on getting more protein intake and then moving towards a specific diet.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','uploads/product/231913950_13_09_2024_10_37_47.jpg','2024-09-13 05:07:47','2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(135,'why-you-should-choose-the-best-physiotherapist-in-pune-for-your-recovery','Why You Should Choose the Best Physiotherapist in Pune for Your Recovery? ','Orthopedics & Physiotherapy','Injury doesn&rsquo;t need an invitation; it comes naturally. But to avoid restrictions at work and in our daily routine, you must eliminate them as ea...','<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(14, 16, 26)\">Injury doesn&rsquo;t need an invitation; it comes naturally. But to avoid restrictions at work and in our daily routine, you must eliminate them as early as possible. Injury can also be minor or major, but there has always been one solution to treating it better. That is physiotherapy. A proficient and skilled physiotherapist helps you in various ways without using any kind of seizure or surgery. The process requires patience in the patient for better results, but trust us, it&rsquo;s all worth it. For every body part, gender, and age, &zwnj;recovery and rehabilitation are different. But the </span><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/physiotherapy-clinic\"><strong>best physiotherapist in Pune</strong></a><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(14, 16, 26)\"> did everything possible to get your body moving again, strong, and working like it used to. There are numerous ways to choose a physiotherapist in Pune city, and today we are going to explore the same. At the end, we will also discuss&zwnj; who is the </span><strong>best physiotherapist in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-col