ction to improve blood circulation, release muscle tension, and accelerate the body&rsquo;s natural healing response. At Dr SumitZ, we provide advanced </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">cupping therapy in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\"> as part of a comprehensive orthopedic and physiotherapy approach for pain relief, injury recovery, and muscular rehabilitation.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Patients often search for </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">cupping therapy near me</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\"> when they experience chronic back pain, neck stiffness, shoulder tightness, or sports-related muscle fatigue. Our clinic in Baner offers personalised cupping sessions, making us a trusted choice for those looking for the </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">best cupping therapy near me</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\"> under medical supervision.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Types of Cupping Therapy Offered</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Dry Cupping Therapy</strong><br />\r\n<span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Dry cupping therapy involves placing suction cups on specific muscle groups without any incisions. This form of suction therapy helps lift tight tissues, increase blood flow, and reduce muscle knots. It is especially effective for posture-related pain, desk-job stiffness, and athletic recovery.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Hot Cupping</strong><br />\r\n<span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Hot cupping uses heat inside the cups to create a deeper suction effect. This technique penetrates deeper muscle layers, helping relieve long-standing stiffness, improve flexibility, and promote relaxation. Hot cupping is commonly used for chronic back pain and muscle tightness.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Wet Cupping Therapy</strong><br />\r\n<span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Wet cupping therapy involves superficial skin incisions followed by suction to remove stagnant blood and toxins. This method is recommended in selected cases of chronic inflammation and pain and is always performed using strict hygiene and safety protocols.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<h3 style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:14pt;margin-bottom:4pt;\"><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:13pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Benefits of Cupping Therapy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 10px; padding-left: 20px;line-height: 28px;\">\r\n	<li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Improves blood circulation and oxygen supply</li>\r\n	<li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Relieves chronic muscle and joint pain</li>\r\n	<li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Reduces inflammation and muscle stiffness</li>\r\n	<li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Enhances muscle recovery after injury</li>\r\n	<li style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Promotes relaxation and stress relief</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Patients frequently inquire about </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">cupping therapy prices in Pune</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">. At Dr SumitZ, pricing depends on the type of cupping, number of cups used, and treatment duration, with complete transparency and no hidden costs.</span></p>\r\n<span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">If you are dealing with persistent muscle pain or restricted movement, choosing professional </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">cupping therapy near me can</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\"> be a natural, safe, and highly effective solution.</span>',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(20,'Dry Needling Therapy','dry-needling-therapy','','','','uploads/page/400697155_27_01_2026_11_35_16.jpg','<p style=\"line-height:1.38;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:12pt;\"><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">Dry Needling Therapy is a modern and evidence-based physiotherapy technique designed to relieve muscular pain, deactivate trigger points, and restore normal movement patterns. If you are searching for </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">dry needling near me</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">, </span><strong style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-variant-alternates:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-variant-emoji:normal; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-position:normal; font-weight:700; vertical-align:baseline; white-space-collapse:preserve\">needle therapy near me</strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent; color:rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family:arial,sans-serif; font-size:11pt; font-varian