otion via google paid search.\r\n\r\nI\'m sorry if this sounds a little technical, but rest assured, these techniques will certainly improve you ranking in search.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested then please let me know. I will send to you our Prices and Packages\r\n\r\nNote: - If you are interested then we will send you, optimization report of your website.\r\nThank you kindly for your time and consideration,\r\nLooking forward to working with you.\r\n\r\nKindest regards,\r\nGracie jakson\r\nSpread the love!\r\n','Contact Us:  Rank Higher on Google - Let\'s Get Started!','New',NULL,'2025-07-21 12:17:59','2025-07-22 00:47:59'),(3963,'Tamara Hager','46806336','hager.tamara@googlemail.com','Our AI-driven service delivers keyword and location-specific visitors to your site, offering a cost-effective alternative to paid ads. Learn more today.\r\n\r\nhttps://ow.ly/2EWF50WrhfS','Contact Us: Drive more visitors to drsumitz.com with our tested AI powered traffic system.','New',NULL,'2025-07-21 13:24:33','2025-07-22 01:54:33'),(3964,'Gerardo Mull','3223585241','mull.gerardo@gmail.com','Hello\r\n\r\nI made $527/day using EmailMachine,  a done-for-you system that builds your list, writes your emails, and sells for you. \r\n\r\nNo tech skills, no experience needed. \r\n\r\nJust plug in and watch the results. Real automation. Real commissions.\r\n\r\nStart now and see how fast you can earn ==>>  https://rb.gy/uxe0l2\r\n\r\nBest regards\r\nGerardo\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you wish to unsubscribe, please reply to this email.','Contact Us: I made $527/day with this simple tool','New',NULL,'2025-07-22 08:59:15','2025-07-22 21:29:15'),(3965,'Laurence Kaylock','668656734','turnerfisher348382@gmail.com','Hello\r\n\r\nNeed Help Managing Your Social Media?\r\n\r\nSocial Media Manager keeps your brand active across all platforms: Facebook, Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, YouTube, Pinterest, and X.\r\n\r\nIncreases visibility, and saves you time. More engagement, more growth without the daily hassle.\r