INSERT INTO `services` VALUES (1,'orthopaedic-center','uploads/category/578229660_27_08_2020_08_52_07.jpg','uploads/category/749666393_20_10_2020_07_13_17.png',' Orthopaedic Clinic','Clinic Services',' Orthopaedic Clinic','We have been served for many years for problems related to bones and joints. For the best orthopedic center in Baner, Pune, let’s get connected ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<p>We provide treatment for all Orthopaedic issues. We are&nbsp; Dr.SumitZ Clinic, Balewadi and Hinjewadi, Pune who treats all Orthopaedic issues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopedic surgery or orthopedics, also spelled orthopaedic is the branch of surgery concerned with conditions involving the musculoskeletal system. Orthopedic surgeons use both surgical and nonsurgical means to treat musculoskeletal trauma, spine diseases, sports injuries, degenerative diseases, infections, tumors, and congenital disorders.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopedic Center generally deals with trauma cases. All modalities of treatment are available under one roof so that the patients does not have to rush other places and hospitals for their treatment. We have highly skilled doctors who design and execute the plan of treating patients with modernised technologies and equipments. All kinds of trauma patients can be managed at this center.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>WE ASSURE THE BEST QUALITY TREATMENT FOR YOUR INJURIES</li>\r\n	<li>WE ACCEPT YOUR ONLINE PAYMENT</li>\r\n	<li>WE HAVE HIGHLY QUALIFIED DOCTORS</li>\r\n	<li>WE HAVE YEARS OF SERVICE EXPERIENCE</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopaedic Center</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First Floor, Krishna Avenue Above Dominos, Opposite D MART, Near Sadanand, Hotel Baner Road, Baner Pune 411045</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Call us on 088559 50433 Email us at Drgsumit@gmail.com</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'We have been served for many years for problems related to bones and joints. For the best orthopedic center in Baner, Pune, let’s get connected ',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(2,'orthopedic-doctor-in-pune','uploads/category/279562148_09_09_2023_11_49_08.webp','uploads/category/360695096_20_10_2020_07_13_38.png','Orthopedic Doctor in Pune','Clinic Services','Orthopedic Doctor in Pune','Looking for the best orthopedic doctor in Baner, Pune? Our expert orthopedic specialist provides comprehensive care for all your musculoskeletal needs. Book an appointment today',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>Orthopedic Doctor in Pune: Dr.Sumitz Clinic</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>When it comes to musculoskeletal health and well-being, finding the <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\">best&nbsp;<span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">orthopedic doctor in Pune</span></a> is crucial. Whether you&#39;re dealing with joint pain, fractures, sports injuries, or any other orthopedic concern, a skilled orthopedic specialist can make a significant difference in your treatment and recovery. Let&#39;s explore the world of orthopedic care and why choosing the right doctor matters.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>The Role of an Orthopedic Doctor</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopedic doctors are medical professionals who specialize in the diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of conditions related to the musculoskeletal system. This intricate system includes bones, joints, muscles, tendons, ligaments, and nerves. Orthopedic specialists have the expertise to address a wide range of issues, from minor discomfort to complex surgeries.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Services Offered by Orthopedic Doctors</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopedic doctors offer a comprehensive range of services, including:</p>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Diagnosis and Evaluation</span>: A skilled orthopedic doctor will conduct thorough evaluations and diagnostic tests to pinpoint the root cause of your orthopedic condition.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Non-Surgical Treatment</span>: They provide non-surgical treatments such as medication, physical therapy, and injections for conditions like arthritis, tendonitis, and more.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Surgical Intervention</span>: In cases where surgery is necessary, orthopedic surgeons have the expertise to perform various procedures, including joint replacements, arthroscopy, and fracture repairs.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<p><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Rehabilitation</span>: Orthopedic doctors emphasize post-surgical rehabilitation to help patients regain mobility, strength, and functionality.</p>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Finding the Right Orthopedic Doctor in Baner</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Choosing the right <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\">orthopedic doctor in Pune</a>, can be a game-changer in your journey to improved musculoskeletal health. Here are some essential considerations:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Qualifications and Experience:</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Look for an orthopedic specialist with the necessary qualifications, certifications, and a proven track record. Experience matters when it comes to diagnosing and treating complex orthopedic conditions.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Specialization:</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopedic doctors often have specific areas of expertise. Whether you&#39;re dealing with spine issues, sports injuries, or joint problems, seek out a specialist who aligns with your needs.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Reputation:</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Consider reading patient reviews and seeking referrals from friends or family. A good reputation and positive patient experiences are indicative of a doctor&#39;s expertise and compassionate care.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><strong>Accessibility:</strong></h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Convenience plays a significant role in your orthopedic care journey. Choose a clinic or hospital with accessible locations and flexible appointment scheduling.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Your musculoskeletal health is too important to overlook. When seeking an <span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\"><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopedic-doctor-in-pune\">orthopedic doctor in Baner</a>, Pune</span>, make an informed decision based on qualifications, specialization, reputation, and accessibility. A trusted orthopedic specialist will guide you on the path to recovery and improved quality of life. Don&#39;t hesitate to reach out and take the first step towards a pain-free and active lifestyle.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Looking for the best orthopedic doctor in Baner, Pune? Our expert orthopedic specialist provides comprehensive care for all your musculoskeletal needs. Book an appointment today',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(3,'physiotherapy-clinic','uploads/category/612570725_03_09_2020_02_19_50.jpg','uploads/category/398663731_20_10_2020_07_14_24.png','Physiotherapy Clinic','Clinic Services','Physiotherapy Clinic','Get permanent solutions to problems regarding the musculoskeletal system in the best physiotherapy clinic in Baner under the eyes of experts. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>Physiotherapy&nbsp;</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In case of acute pain, restricting you to carrying out a routine expected movement, we focus on &quot;Fast Pain relief&quot;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>To achieve faster pain relief, we give passive relaxing stretches, joint and soft tissue mobilizations, conventional drugless electrotherapy, dry needling, kinesiology taping, etc depending on the need of the condition.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For INSTANT pain relief, in case of very acute painful conditions, restricting you from an important meeting, event, or game, we can help you with joint and soft tissue mobilizations with the support of kinesiology taping for the desired results. (Please understand acute conditions can be due to underlying chronic conditions and may require a complete solution to fix the root cause.)<br />\r\n&nbsp;We understand that concept of fitness is different for different individuals. For white-collar workers, it&#39;s &quot;pain-free office life&quot; and for sports enthusiasts, it is &quot; high endurance&quot; in performance. We can help you at any level of physical rehabilitation, from &quot;pain relief to performance enhancement.&quot;<br />\r\nOnce you are out of the acute painful zone, we move you to a complete tailor-made rehabilitative exercises program. After you have mastered the exercises, we provide a &quot; Home Exercise Program&quot; ( H.E.P) in video or printed version according to your convenience.<br />\r\nWe ensure that you keep timely follow-ups to check if the exercises are performed correctly and to improvise at the right times.<br />\r\nIf you are an athlete or sports enthusiast who wishes to continue and progress on your fitness journey, we help you with sports rehabilitation experts, who can guide you with getting back with sports and improving performance.<br />\r\nTo avoid any recurrence of symptoms, we provide the best Ergonomic solutions to &quot; YOU&quot;. We evaluate your workstation by reviewing the photos you provide us and suggest changes if any.<br />\r\nTreating the root cause is our motto, and we go with furniture, pillows, mattresses, and shoes to avoid any possible relapses of symptoms.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Physio Therapy Clinic</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First Floor, Krishna Avenue Above Dominos, Opposite D MART, Near Sadanand, Hotel Baner Road, Baner Pune 411045</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Call us on 088559 50433 Email us at Drgsumit@gmail.com</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Get permanent solutions to problems regarding the musculoskeletal system in the best physiotherapy clinic in Baner under the eyes of experts. ',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(4,'physiotherapy-treatment','uploads/category/20127083_03_09_2020_05_30_22.jpg','uploads/category/635079362_20_10_2020_07_14_49.png','Physiotherapy Treatment','Clinic Services','Physiotherapy Treatment','Treatment with the medical facility of BMD machines, pathology lab, and a team of experts is available in the physiotherapy treatment clinic in Pune ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>What to expect from a visit?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide treatment for Physiotherapy Treatment and our center is located in Baner, Dr. SumitZ Orthopaedic and Physiotherapy Clinic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Each session with a physiotherapist is unique because it depends on the client&rsquo;s health issues and needs. However, a visit to a physiotherapist generally includes:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Learning about the patient&rsquo;s medical history</li>\r\n	<li>Assessing and diagnosing the patient&rsquo;s condition and needs Helping the patient set and reach physical goals</li>\r\n	<li>Creating a treatment plan that accounts for the patient&rsquo;s health, lifestyle, and activities Prescribing a course of exercises and necessary devices</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>As professionals, physiotherapists are experts at providing physiotherapy treatment for:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Preventing injury and disability</li>\r\n	<li>Managing acute and chronic conditions</li>\r\n	<li>Improving and maintaining optimal physical performance</li>\r\n	<li>Rehabilitating injury and the effects of disease or disability</li>\r\n	<li>Educating patients to prevent the re-occurrence of an injury</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients may be referred to or seek assistance from a physiotherapist for a variety of health issues and receive valuable assistance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;Physiotherapy can be defined as a treatment method that focuses on the science of movement and helps people to restore, maintain and maximize their physical strength, function, motion, and overall well-being by addressing the underlying physical issues.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A common question for people that have never visited a physiotherapist is the very basic question &ldquo;What is Physiotherapy?&rdquo;. Physiotherapy encompasses rehabilitation, injury prevention, and health promotion/fitness. The profession employs a holistic approach to treatment, looking at the patient&rsquo;s lifestyle and engaging them in their own treatment.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Treatment with the medical facility of BMD machines, pathology lab, and a team of experts is available in the physiotherapy treatment clinic in Pune ',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(5,'physiotherapy-services-in-baner','uploads/category/143782991_03_09_2020_05_30_57.jpg','uploads/category/99903905_20_10_2020_07_15_14.png','Physiotherapy at Home','Clinic Services','Physiotherapy at Home','Physiotherapists in Pune have years of experience and are experts in handling machines like BMD and X-rays. Let’s get connected if you have any queries',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<p>Physiotherapy is a healthcare profession that assists people to restore, maintain and maximize their strength, function, movement, and overall well-being. The terms &quot;physiotherapy&quot; and &quot;physical therapy&quot; mean the same thing and are used interchangeably, as are the terms &ldquo;physiotherapist&rdquo; and &ldquo;physical therapist&rdquo;.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A common question for people that have never visited a physiotherapist is the very basic question &ldquo;What is Physiotherapy?&rdquo;. Physiotherapy encompasses rehabilitation, injury prevention, and health promotion/fitness. The profession employs a holistic approach to treatment, looking at the patient&rsquo;s lifestyle and engaging them in their own treatment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Physiotherapy can be defined as a treatment method that focuses on the science of movement and helps people to restore, maintain and maximize their physical strength, function, motion, and overall well-being by addressing the underlying physical issues.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Physiotherapists in Pune have years of experience and are experts in handling machines like BMD and X-rays. Let’s get connected if you have any queries',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(6,'x-ray-center','uploads/category/372222850_03_09_2020_05_31_24.jpg','uploads/category/485750461_20_10_2020_07_53_52.png','X Ray Center','Clinic Services','X Ray Center','Are you looking for the best X-ray center in Baner and Pune? Then this is the time to stop the search and get treatment in Pune under the eyes of experts  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>Digital Xray:&nbsp;How the Test is Performed</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The test is performed in a radiology department by an x-ray technologist. The positioning of the patient, x-ray machine, and film depends on the type of study and area of interest. Multiple individual views may be requested.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Much like conventional photography, motion causes blurry images on radiographs, and thus, patients may be asked to hold their breath or not move during the brief exposure (about 1 second).</p>\r\n\r\n<p>How to Prepare for the Test</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Prior to the examination, Inform the health care provider if you are pregnant, may be pregnant, If abdominal studies are planned and you have had a barium contrast study (such as a barium enema, upper GI series, or barium swallow) in the last 4 days, the test may be delayed until the contrast has fully passed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You will remove all jewelry and wear a hospital gown during the x-ray examination because metal and certain clothing can obscure the images and require repeat studies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>XRAY:&nbsp;</strong>X-rays are a form of electromagnetic radiation, just like visible light. In a healthcare setting, a machines sends individual x-ray particles, called photons. These particles pass through the body. A computer or special film is used to record the images that are created.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Structures that are dense (such as bone) will block most of the x-ray particles and will appear white. Metal and contrast media (special dye used to highlight areas of the body) will also appear white. Structures containing air will be black, and muscle, fat, and fluid will appear as shades of gray.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>X Ray Center</p>\r\n\r\n<p>First Floor, Krishna Avenue Above Dominos, Opposite D MART, Near Sadanand, Hotel Baner Road, Baner Pune 411045</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Call us on 088559 50433 Email us at Drgsumit@gmail.com</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Are you looking for the best X-ray center in Baner and Pune? Then this is the time to stop the search and get treatment in Pune under the eyes of experts  ',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(7,'pathology-laboratory','uploads/category/724762919_03_11_2022_03_35_12.jpg','uploads/category/457272134_20_10_2020_07_54_34.png','Pathology Laboratory','Clinic Services','Pathology Laboratory','Diagnosed the problem with our best pathology laboratory in Pune and get accurate results without consumption of enough time ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>Introduction to the Pathology Laboratory</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Healthcare providers may be unfamiliar with the workings of the pathology laboratory. The delivery of a specimen to the pathology laboratory initiates a complex series of events resulting in a pathologic diagnosis/interpretation. The following section reviews the importance and critical objectives in the pathologic evaluation of tissue and provides information on the types and members of the pathology laboratory.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Importance of pathologic examination</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The cancer diagnosis is not conclusively established, nor safely assumed, in the absence of a tissue diagnosis, nor should definitive therapy for cancer, with rare exceptions, be undertaken. Policies supporting this practice are written into the bylaws of most hospitals and are regularly monitored by hospital tissue committees and accrediting agencies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The goal of pathology examination of tissue is to provide accurate, specific, and sufficiently comprehensive diagnoses to enable the treating physician to develop an optimal plan of treatment. There are hundreds of varieties of tumors, most with characteristic biology, that require accurate diagnosis by pathologists. Data on markers with prognostic and predictive significance are also routinely incorporated into pathology reports, allowing individualized treatment plans for patients. It is not only important to obtain sufficient tissue for a specific diagnosis of malignancy, but for many malignancies, additional tissue is required for prognostic and predictive ancillary studies.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While some have postulated that we are moving toward a gene/mutation-driven categorization of tumors replacing disease site clinics and treatment planning (e.g., PIK3CA mutated carcinomas instead of &ldquo;ovarian&rdquo; cancer or &ldquo;breast&rdquo; cancer), data is accumulating that histology, morphology, disease site location and microenvironment in addition to genomic changes are still important factors in understanding the disease biology for treatment planning.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Types of pathology labs</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hospital labs:&nbsp;</strong>Almost all hospitals contain a laboratory to support the clinical services offered at the hospital. The specific pathology services would include both anatomic (surgical pathology, cytopathology, autopsy) and clinical (laboratory medicine) pathology at most hospitals. Most, if not all, inpatients and many outpatients seen by hospital-affiliated physicians require tests performed by hospital labs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Reference labs:&nbsp;</strong>Reference labs are usually private, commercial facilities that do both high volume and specialty (high complexity and/or rare) laboratory testing. Most of these tests are referred from physician&rsquo;s offices, hospital facilities,s and other patient care facilities such as nursing homes. Reference labs, typically located at a site other than the healthcare facilities, are often used for specialized tests that are ordered only occasionally or require special equipment for analysis.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Public health labs:&nbsp;</strong>Public health laboratories are typically run by state and local health departments to diagnose and protect the public from health threats such as outbreaks of infectious disease. These labs perform tests to monitor the prevalence of certain diseases in the community which is a public health concern, such as outbreaks of foodborne or waterborne illnesses or the detection of unique infectious agents.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Members of the pathology lab</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The staff of most clinical laboratories is diverse. A non-comprehensive summary of the major types of individuals found in these laboratories is provided below.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Anatomic pathology which encompasses surgical pathology, cytopathology,y and autopsy pathology includes the following</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pathologists:&nbsp;</strong>Physicians with special training in the diagnosis and detection of disease. Practicing pathologists may be subspecialty or general pathologists, depending on the types of cases they review daily. Some pathologists may perform a subspecialty fellowship in a specific area of pathology such as cytopathology, hematopathology, dermatopathology, neuropathology, neuropathology, etc.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Pathologists&#39; assistants (PAs):&nbsp;</strong>These individuals assist with the gross description and dissection of surgical cases and biopsies, working closely with supervising pathologists. PAs may also assist in the technical aspects of intraoperative assessment such as frozen section and selection of tissue for research and clinical trials (tissue procurement).</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Cytotechnologists:&nbsp;</strong>These individuals assist in screening specimens that are composed of small samples of cells rather than whole sections of tissue, e.g., Pap smear specimens. After screening and marking diagnostic cells in slides, a cytotechnologist refers cases with abnormal cells to pathologists for review. Other common cytologic specimens include fine needle aspirations (FNAs), washings or scrapings of cells,s, and other body fluids.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Histotechnologists:&nbsp;</strong>These individuals manage the processing of tissue in the laboratory and perform the technical components of making slides from tissue for evaluation by a pathologist. These components include fixing the tissue, embedding it in paraffin, sectioning tissue onto slides, and staining the tissue on slides.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Clinical pathology which encompasses laboratory medicine includes the following:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>PathologistsPh.D.D scientists: these</strong>&nbsp;professionals provide direction of clinical labs to ensure accurate and timely reporting of lab tests and serve as a resource for result interpretation to clinicians. Individuals often have specific training in one or more of the following areas: clinical chemistry, microbiology, molecular pathology, hematology, immunology,y, and blood banking.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Medical laboratory technicians:&nbsp;</strong>These health care professionals perform laboratory testing and analysis on body fluids and other specimens to help determine the presence or absence of disease.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Phlebotomists: These healthcare</strong>&nbsp;professionals are trained to draw blood from a patient for clinical testing, transfusions, donation,s or research.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Diagnosed the problem with our best pathology laboratory in Pune and get accurate results without consumption of enough time ',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(8,'pediatric-orthopaedic-doctor','uploads/category/852912812_03_11_2022_03_31_54.jpg','uploads/category/382192199_20_10_2020_07_16_06.png','Pediatric Orthopaedic Doctor','Clinic Services','Pediatric Orthopaedic Doctor','As per the survey - the pediatric population of patients is on the rise with our best pediatric doctor in Baner and Pune.',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>Who is Pediatric Orthopaedist?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>A pediatric orthopaedist is the best-trained and most experienced doctor to properly evaluate and treat musculoskeletal (bone, joint, or muscle) problems in a child who is still growing. This includes newborn babies through teenagers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Children are not just small adults. This is especially true when it comes to children&#39;s bones and joints, and the problems they can have with their musculoskeletal system. A pediatric orthopaedist is the best-trained and most experienced doctor to properly evaluate and treat bone or joint or muscle problems in a child who is still growing. A pediatric orthopedic surgeon is a doctor who takes care of children with musculoskeletal problems. That means any child with a bone, joint, or muscle problem or disease and certain nerve problems and diseases. If your child has something wrong with his or her arms, legs, hands, feet, or spine, a pediatric orthopaedist is most likely to be the most appropriate doctor to see. Pediatric orthopaedists take care of this. Abnormalities in how children walkDifferences in leg length deformities that are present at birth such as clubfeet and dislocated hips, deformities of hand, neck, and back and feet deformities that develop later in childhood such as crooked legs and curved spines (scoliosis)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A pediatric orthopaedist also takes care of acute problems such as Broken bonesInfections in bones or jointsTumor in bones</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'As per the survey - the pediatric population of patients is on the rise with our best pediatric doctor in Baner and Pune.',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(9,'orthopaedic-surgeon','uploads/category/211837990_03_09_2020_05_33_16.jpg','uploads/category/','Orthopaedic Surgeon','Clinic Services','Orthopaedic Surgeon','The population of orthopedic surgeons in the country is around 72%, so stay in touch with our best orthopedic surgeons in baner for future queries',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<h2>An orthopedic surgeon is what?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In order to prevent, diagnose, and cure diseases of the bones, joints, ligaments, tendons, and muscles, orthopedic surgeons devote their careers to this field.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>While some orthopaedists are generalists, others focus on certain body parts, such as:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Knee and hip</li>\r\n	<li>Ankle and foot</li>\r\n	<li>Elbow and shoulder</li>\r\n	<li>Hand</li>\r\n	<li>Spine</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>WHAT ARE THE TREATMENTS OF AN ORTHOPAEDIC SURGEON?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>First, orthopedic surgeons look into nonsurgical options like pain medication or therapy. If necessary, they also possess the knowledge to undertake surgery to treat a disease or repair an injury.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The most common reason people visit their doctors each year is musculoskeletal pain.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Did you know that orthopedic surgeons also treat patients for these issues? Many people are aware that orthopedic surgeons replace aching joints and treat fractured bones.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Athletic injuries</li>\r\n	<li>Spinal stenosis, ruptured discs, and back discomfort</li>\r\n	<li>Bone cancer</li>\r\n	<li>Hand injury, hand arthritis, and carpal tunnel syndrome</li>\r\n	<li>Hip dysplasia, bow legs, and club feet</li>\r\n	<li>Orthopedic injuries</li>\r\n	<li>Extending the limbs</li>\r\n	<li>Bunions, foot and ankle injuries, and Achilles tendon injuries</li>\r\n	<li>Osteoporosis Arthritis</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'The population of orthopedic surgeons in the country is around 72%, so stay in touch with our best orthopedic surgeons in baner for future queries',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(10,'nutrition-dietitian','uploads/category/120212691_02_11_2022_04_48_05.jpg','uploads/category/','Nutrition & Dietitian','Clinic Services','Nutrition & Dietitian','A balanced diet and proper nutrition lower the risk of future diseases and now you can connect with the best nutrition and dietician in Banerand Pune .',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<p>We have a team of&nbsp;Nutritionists and dieticians who are qualified health professionals and will help you with your health-related issues.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nutritionists and dieticians are qualified health professionals that assess, diagnose, and treat health problems at the individual level and work to solve health problems at the public health level.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Their work varies from private clinics to larger hospitals and governmental departments. They work in the food industry, the workplace, catering and hospitality, athletics, and the media. Their work can also span the sectors of mental health, learning disabilities, community health centers, and public health centers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Nutritionists and dieticians work with teams of other professionals to treat complicated health conditions like eating disorders, food allergies and sensitivities, diabetes, chronic fatigue, kidney failure, IBS syndrome, malnutrition, and other health problems. They work to help individuals and influence health policy to ensure the health and safety of the general population.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'A balanced diet and proper nutrition lower the risk of future diseases and now you can connect with the best nutrition and dietician in Banerand Pune .',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(11,'bmd-test-in-pune','uploads/category/894242277_16_09_2020_04_33_25.jpg','uploads/category/','BMD Test ','Clinic Services','BMD Test ','Discover top Bone Densitometry experts in Pune at Dr. Sumitz Clinic. Trusted specialists for accurate bone health assessments. Book your appointment now!',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<p>A Bone Mineral Density (BMD) test in Pune, or anywhere else, is a medical diagnostic procedure performed to assess the density and strength of an individual&#39;s bones. This test is primarily conducted to evaluate the risk of osteoporosis and fractures. Osteoporosis is a condition characterized by a decrease in bone density, making bones fragile and prone to fractures even with minor trauma.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>The BMD test in Pune serves several important purposes:</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Osteoporosis Diagnosis</span>:</h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>It helps in identifying individuals with osteoporosis or those at risk of developing it. Early detection is crucial for initiating preventive measures and timely treatment.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Fracture Risk Assessment</span>:</h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>By measuring bone density, the BMD test assists healthcare professionals in predicting the likelihood of fractures in the future. This information is vital for developing appropriate strategies to prevent fractures, especially in older adults.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Treatment Monitoring</span>:</h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For individuals already diagnosed with osteoporosis, regular BMD testing helps monitor the effectiveness of ongoing treatments and interventions.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Medication Decision</span>:</h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>BMD test results can guide healthcare providers in deciding whether medications to improve bone density are necessary for the patient.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>\r\n	<h3><span style=\"color:var(--tw-prose-bold)\">Overall Bone Health</span>:</h3>\r\n	</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Beyond osteoporosis, the BMD test can provide insights into an individual&#39;s overall bone health, helping to identify conditions or lifestyle factors that may be impacting bone strength.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>In Pune, this test is readily available at various healthcare facilities and clinics, enabling individuals to proactively manage their bone health and reduce the risk of fractures and osteoporosis-related complications. It is particularly important for postmenopausal women, older adults, and those with risk factors such as a family history of osteoporosis or prolonged use of certain medications. In conclusion, a<a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/osteoporosis-treatment\"> </a><a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/treatments/osteoporosis-treatment\">BMD test in Pune</a> plays a critical role in assessing bone health, diagnosing osteoporosis, and guiding preventive and therapeutic strategies to maintain strong and healthy bones, thereby enhancing an individual&#39;s quality of life and reducing the risk of fractures.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Discover top Bone Densitometry experts in Pune at Dr. Sumitz Clinic. Trusted specialists for accurate bone health assessments. Book your appointment now!',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(12,'digital-opg-facility','uploads/category/816321848_11_02_2021_06_53_28.jpg','uploads/category/','Digital OPG Facility','Clinic Services','Digital OPG Facility','To assess the overall health of your teeth - Digital OPG facilities provided clinic in Pune and Baner come into the picture. Get treated with this latest machine. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<p>An OPG can be the eye of a lower-face bird or a wide read-x, which displays all the teeth of the upper and lower jaws on a film. It displays the number, position, and growth of all teeth to which they have not yet been exposed or erupted. This is different from small close-up X-ray dentists of individual teeth. An OPG can also reveal problems with the jaw bone and joints that connect the job bone to the head called the temporomandibular joint or TMJ. For orthodontic treatment planning, the OPG may be requested for the assessment of wisdom teeth or for a general overview of teeth and bone-supporting teeth.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3>Process</h3>\r\n\r\n<p>You may be asked to remove jewelry, eyeglasses, and any metal objects that may obscure the images. You will be asked to gently bite down on a piece of sterile mouth to rest on a small shelf and stabilize your head. This is very important when taking an X-ray. You will not feel any discomfort during the process.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dr.SumitZ Clinic provides the best treatment. You can contact us for further information.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'To assess the overall health of your teeth - Digital OPG facilities provided clinic in Pune and Baner come into the picture. Get treated with this latest machine. ',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL),(13,'homeopathy-care','uploads/category/646202064_03_10_2023_04_39_00.jpg','uploads/category/','Homeopathy Care','Clinic Services','Homeopathy Care','Dr. Sumitz is the best homeopathy clinic in Balewadi & provide holistic solutions to all health issues. Consult our doctors to get the best homeopathic treatment in Baner, Pune',NULL,NULL,NULL,'Service Overview','<p>German MD Invented by physician, Dr. Samuel Hahnemann, homeopathy has been in existence for over 200 years! The most wonderful part of homeopathy and its scope in the service of mankind is its ability to provide relief in diseases like cancer, kidney failure, tuberculosis, paralysis.</p>\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'Dr. Sumitz is the best homeopathy clinic in Balewadi & provide holistic solutions to all health issues. Consult our doctors to get the best homeopathic treatment in Baner, Pune',1,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22',NULL);
