INSERT INTO `testimonials` VALUES (1,'Nilam Jadhav','Verified Patient','Very cooperative doctor.He explained the treatment in very easy words and clearly.Within 3 sessions my knee pain was absolutely fine.thnx doc.',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(2,'Rajani','Verified Patient','I visited Dr Sumit Gupta for pain in my wrist, his physiotherapy treatment gave me immediate relief from pain. He is very friendly and makes each patient feel very comfortable. Thank you Dr Gupta.',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(3,'Tejashree Gundeti','Verified Patient','The doctor very well explained my condition to me and prescribed medicines and physiotherapy which helped me lot to recover soon.',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(4,'Nidhi','Verified Patient','<p>Diagnosis was quick, avoided unnecessary / excessive tests. Very practical in approach and responsive.Treatment did provide relief</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(5,'Aditi','Verified Patient','<p>Took my treatment from SumitZ clinic . Had an amazing experience with them! Staff is outstanding and very supportive. Extremely clean environment and high quality equipments add up to satisfying experience ! Excellent communication and interaction with clients. And off course, up to the mark treatment !!! Would highly recommend to friends and relatives for physiotherapy .</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(6,'Mayuri karmakar','Verified Patient','<p>Dr. Sumit is a very polite and knowledgeable doctor. He listens to you carefully and provides resolution accordingly. I was having hand pain from quite sometime but was not able to figure out that it could be due to lack of vitamin in my body. He told me to get some tests and then prescribed me medicines and also gave me a diet chart to follow. The best thing about his clinic is that they have very polite staff and doctors.</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(7,'Aniket Khaire','Verified Patient','<p>Thanks dr sumit for orthopaedic.Very safe place in COVID-19.</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(8,'Adarsh','Verified Patient','<p>My experience is very good with Dr Sumit. Not only did he do very successful video consulting for my son’s injury, but also delivered medicines with prescription at my doorstep amidst this pandemic situation</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(9,'Vallabh Kshirsagar','Verified Patient','<p>Very Good experience with Dr Sumit, he is very nice and friendly, getting treatment from him for my lower back pain already relived mentally after talking to him.... If you are suffering from any pain, this is the best place for orthopedic and physiotherapy treatment. Consider Visiting Dr Sumitz clinic Baner first before going anywhere else.</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(10,'Durgesh Singh','Verified Patient','<p>Doctor Sumit is a very professional and polite Doctor, he is very cooperative with his patients, make them comfortable, listen to them and treat them accordingly. Highly recommend. I am very satisfied ,staff are also very good and cooperation</p>',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(11,'Narendra Kale','Verified Patient','Hello Doctor Sumit,<br />\r\nThanks for the IFT and physio therapy sessions in the first week of August.<br />\r\nI could easily do trekking in Himalayas at Uttarakhand along with valley of flowers. No pain and stress in the right knee. Practicing physio exercises after coming back also.',5,NULL,0,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22');
