INSERT INTO `treatments` VALUES (1,'ORTHOPAEDIC TREATMENT','orthopaedic-treatment','uploads/category/315533686_02_09_2020_08_19_59.jpg','<h1>Orthopedics services in Baner, Pune -&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nOrthopedics, sometimes known as orthopedic services, is concerned with the treatment of the musculoskeletal system. Your bones, joints, ligaments, tendons, and muscles are all included.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Information</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many medical conditions may affect the bones, joints, ligaments, tendons, and muscles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bone issues may include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Deformities of the bones</li>\r\n	<li>Infections of the bones</li>\r\n	<li>Tumors of the bones</li>\r\n	<li>Fractures</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Joint issues may include:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Arthritis</li>\r\n	<li>Bursitis</li>\r\n	<li>Dislocation</li>\r\n	<li>Joint discomfort</li>\r\n	<li>Inflammation or edema of the joints</li>\r\n	<li>Tears in ligaments and tendons</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>The following are examples of common orthopedic-related diagnoses depending on body part:</h1>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>FOOT AND ANKLE</li>\r\n	<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n	<li>Bunions</li>\r\n	<li>Plantar fasciitis is a kind of fasciitis that affects the sole of the foot.</li>\r\n	<li>Deformities of the foot and ankle</li>\r\n	<li>Fractures</li>\r\n	<li>Toe hammer</li>\r\n	<li>Heel ache</li>\r\n	<li>Foot spurs</li>\r\n	<li>Arthritis and joint discomfort</li>\r\n	<li>Sprains</li>\r\n	<li>Tarsal tunnel syndrome</li>\r\n	<li>Sesamoiditis</li>\r\n	<li>Tendon or ligament damage</li>\r\n	<li>WRIST AND HAND</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','Orthopedic Treatment in Pune | Dr.SumitZ Clinic','Dr.SumitZ Clinic provides orthopedic treatment for all kinds of musculoskeletal problems such as spine, hip, shoulder, knee, neck, back, and ankle. Visit us today.','orthopedic doctor in balewadi, orthopedic treatment in baner, orthopedic clinic in baner, orthopedic doctor in baner, Orthopaedic Center in baner, orthopedic clinic in pune','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(2,'ORTHOPAEDIC PROCESS','orthopaedic-process','uploads/category/693471688_03_11_2022_03_26_41.jpg','<p>We are Dr. Sumit Orthopedic and Physiotherapy Clinic provies treatment for the Orthopedic Procedure and our Center is located in Baner, Balewadi and Hinjewadi.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients come with their problems, our orthopaedic specialists evaluate and diagnose them well with care with a customized treatment plan which the patient needs to follow properly. For immediate pain relief we provide a short-term medicine course that also provides comfort. Multidisciplinary treatments are planned according to the patient&rsquo;s condition. Rather than going for inflexible protocols, therapies are given according to the patient&rsquo;s requirement.</p>\r\n\r\n<h1>Orthopaedic Surgery -</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Orthopaedic surgery is a procedure on your musculoskeletal system. It can diagnose, treat, repair and prevent conditions that affect your bones, muscles and joints. Common types of orthopaedic surgery are ACL surgery and knee replacement surgery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is orthopaedic surgery? Orthopaedic surgery is a medical specialty dedicated to treating, diagnosing or preventing conditions or injuries that affect your musculoskeletal system. Your musculoskeletal system contains your: Bones. Muscles. Joints. Tendons and ligaments. Cartilage. Soft tissues.</p>\r\n','Orthopedic Treatment Process Clinic in Pune  | Dr.Sumitz','Bones are a delicate part of the human body, and you need to treat them with care. Then connect with the orthopedic treatment process clinic in Pune ','Orthopedic Treatment Process Clinic in Pune, Orthopedic Treatment Process Clinic in Baner, Orthopedic Treatment Clinic in Pune','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(3,'ORTHOPAEDIC PAEDIATRIC','orthopaedic-pediatrician-in-baner','uploads/category/345166082_03_11_2022_03_31_18.jpg','<h1>Who are&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(78, 78, 78)\">Paediatric orthopaedics?</span></h1>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"color:rgb(78, 78, 78)\">Paediatric orthopaedics is the branch of medicine that deals with</span><strong>&nbsp;injuries and musculoskeletal conditions in children and teens</strong><span style=\"color:rgb(78, 78, 78)\">. It is also sometimes known as paediatric orthopaedic surgery.&nbsp;The most common issues that children experience are foot deformities, gait disturbances, and hip dysplasia, among others. These issues can be hereditary, congenital, or acquired.</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p>The Department of Paediatric Orthopedics has a very well-trained and experienced team of Paediatric Orthopaedic surgeons who provide state-of-the-art complete care for your child&rsquo;s bones and joints. They are ably supported by Paediatric Physiotherapists, Occupational Therapists, Paediatric Neurologists, Paediatric Intensivists and Paediatric Endocrinologists to cover all aspects of Paediatric Orthopaedic care.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Conditions</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Congenital Musculoskeletal Anomalies</li>\r\n	<li>Musculoskeletal Bone &amp; Joint Infections</li>\r\n	<li>Cerebral Palsy &amp; Neuromuscular Condition</li>\r\n	<li>Paediatric Trauma</li>\r\n	<li>Spina Bifida</li>\r\n	<li>Osteogenesis Imperfecta</li>\r\n	<li>Club foot</li>\r\n	<li>Rehabilitation and Therapy</li>\r\n	<li>Paediatric Foot and Ankle Deformity</li>\r\n	<li>Sports Injuries</li>\r\n	<li>Neonatal Hip Dysplasia</li>\r\n	<li>Paediatric Spine Injuries</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Procedure</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Fractures</li>\r\n	<li>Surgeries for Cerebral Palsy</li>\r\n	<li>Deformity Correction</li>\r\n	<li>Hip Dysplasia</li>\r\n	<li>Bone and Joint Infection</li>\r\n	<li>Limb Lengthening</li>\r\n	<li>Osteogenesis Imperfecta</li>\r\n	<li>Paediatric Sports (Hip &amp; Knee)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','Orthopedic Pediatric Treatment Clinic in Pune | Dr.SumitZ Clinic','Visit the best orthopedic pediatric treatment clinic in Pune if your child has been diagnosed with any pediatric symptoms. ','orthopaedic paediatric in baner, orthopaedic paediatric treatment in baner','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(4,'GENERAL PHYSICAL THERAPY','general-physical-therapy','uploads/category/420833720_02_11_2022_04_39_40.jpg','<h1>General Physical Therapy</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide treatment for the General Physical Therapy center in Baner, by Dr. SumitZ Orthopaedic and physiotherapy clinic Baner.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Physical Therapy (PT), also known as Physiotherapy is an allied health profession in which mobilization, health education, evidence-based kinesiology, exercise prescription, electrical and physical agents, and remedies for impairments are used. Apart from clinical practice, other activities involved in the physical therapy profession include research, education, consulting, and administration. Physiotherapy services may be provided with or in primary care treatment, or in conjunction with other medical services.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scheduling general physical therapy has become simpler than before. Our personalized therapies provide the resources to patients they need to get their health on track. Get in touch and make an appointment at your earliest convenience.</p>\r\n','General physiotherapy Treatment in Pune | Dr.Sumitz','Physiotherapy helps both your physical and mental wellness. Make an appointment with the best physiotherapy treatment centre in Pune.','Physical Therapy Treatment in Pune, Best Physical Therapy Treatment in Pune, Physical Therap Treatment in Baner, ','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(5,'POST SURGICAL PHYSICAL THERAPY','post-surgical-physical-therapy','uploads/category/949891714_03_11_2022_03_21_36.jpg','<h1>POST-SURGICAL PHYSICAL THERAPY</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Sumitz is the place where you need to come regarding quality Post-OP Therapy. At every step, our professional team guides our patients and their families. If you are in pain and suffering from this problem then you need to contact us for your help.</p>\r\n','Post Op Physical Therapy Treatment in Baner| Dr. Sumitz','Have you gone for physiotherapy treatment after any operation? If the answer is no, visit the Post Op Physical Therapy Treatment in Baner, Pune','','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(6,'PHYSICAL THERAPY FOR ATHLETES','physical-therapy-for-athletes','uploads/category/649217639_01_09_2020_12_49_57.jpg','<h1>Physical Therapy For Athletes -&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Physical therapy works to assist an athlete to rebuild strength and movement after an injury through different exercises, stretches, and specialized techniques. It can also help an athlete manage pain and prevent avoidable damage in the future.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>THESE ARE THE SEVEN MAIN BENEFITS OF SPORTS PHYSICAL THERAPY -</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>1. IMPROVED RANGE OF MOTION<br />\r\nIn live athletics, joints are pushed to the limit of their strength. This is the location where wounded tissues might erupt and be ripped or harmed. When an athlete is forced to return to sports, an experienced physical therapist must push their patient to the brink of tissue overload in order to prepare the tissue for live athletics. Physical therapists must push an athlete&#39;s joints to their limits to ensure there is no discomfort, resistance, laxity, or fear, which aids in the improvement of an athlete&#39;s range of motion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>2. NEUROMUSCULAR MANAGEMENT</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Sports medicine physical therapists are responsible for coordinating the different body components to function together. The movement of the joints by the muscles, tendons, and nerves is the focus of neuromuscular coordination. By concentrating on certain areas of the body, the wounded athlete prepares to return to sports by increasing movement speed during workouts and gradually increasing weight.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3. THE TECHNIQUE</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many non-sports physical therapists overlook the importance of teaching athletes how to position or move their bodies in order to execute an activity or task. Small information regarding placement and technique, on the other hand, may assist an athlete in appropriately aligning their body to load suitable tissue (bone, tendons, muscles), unload incorrect tissue, preserve energy, and improve movement efficiency and performance. As a result, our sports physical therapists begin technique instruction for particular exercises on day one and stay technique oriented throughout all levels and stages of the ARC Progression.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>4. MUSCLE ALIGNMENT</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Athletes often go in all directions in order to master their sport and compete at a high level. This may result in recurrent training. When this occurs, highlighted muscles may become overworked in comparison to their counterpart, resulting in the dominant muscle group. Athletes must exercise muscle groups in addition to sport-specific training to balance the strain on joints and tendons and establish synergy in the body to prevent injury and return to active sports.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>5. STRENGTH, POWER, AND SPEED</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Many different power, strength, and speed combinations may be necessary depending on an athlete&#39;s sport. Athletes must load their muscles with larger weights, increase their sets, and decrease the repetitions each set to enhance muscular strength and growth (hypertrophy). Many patients do three sets of ten with weights that are insufficiently difficult to generate actual muscle strength. Maximum power is defined as the capacity to transfer weight over a long distance in the shortest amount of time. To increase power, athletes must be forced to work as swiftly as possible against a resistance. The capacity to move the body (or portions of the body) as quickly as possible is referred to as speed. Most sports need swift movement, and each patient necessitates specialized workouts to coordinate body components where there is a secure foundation that provides speed.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>TORQUE AT JOINTS</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Return to practically any sport requires rotational stress at high velocity. One of the primary goals of sports physical therapy for athletes is to generate and manage rotational force on joints and body parts. Manual treatment and functional exercise progression, beginning with single-plane movements and continuing to multi-plane and multi-joint motions, are included.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7. GET THE ATHLETE READY FOR COACHING</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When advanced physical treatment is almost finished, the athlete should be able to return to practice and coaching. This combination of sports treatment and live athletics helps the athlete to ensure that they may return to their activity without experiencing any new ailments. Working out any remaining areas of discomfort or tightness can enable a safe return to coaches who want an athlete to be ready to perform at their best.</p>\r\n','Physical Therapy in Pune for Athletes | Dr Sumitz Clinic ','To display the best performance on the ground, you need the assistance of the Physical Therapy in Pune for Athletes . In this clinic, you will be ready for tomorrow.  ','Physical Therapy in Pune for Athletes, Physical Therapy in Baner for Athletes, Physical Therapy Treatment in Pune for Athletes','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(7,'ERGONOMICS','ergonomics','uploads/category/499668296_01_09_2020_12_52_33.jpg','<h1>What is Ergonomics?</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>The practice of creating or organizing workplaces, items, and systems to fit their users of them is known as ergonomics.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most people who have heard of ergonomics assume it has to do with seats or the design of automobile controls and instruments, and it does, but it also encompasses a lot more. Anything that involves humans, such as workplaces, sports and leisure activities, and health and safety, must be designed with ergonomics in mind.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The goal of ergonomics, or &quot;human factors&quot; as it is known in North America, is to gain knowledge about human capabilities and limitations and then use that knowledge to enhance how people interact with objects, systems, and surroundings. The goal of ergonomics is to reduce the risk of injury in workplaces and settings.</p>\r\n','Ergonomics Treatment And Clinic in Pune | Dr.Sumitz Clinic ','Prolong periods of sitting at one desk may cause ailments in bones and joints -  ergonomics, we are treating this problem in our best ergonomics treatment and clinic in Pune ','Ergonomics Treatment Clinic in Pune, Ergonomics Treatment in Pune, Ergonomics Treatment in Baner, Ergonomics Treatment Clinic in Baner ','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(8,'DIGITAL X-RAY FOR DIAGNOSIS','digital-x-ray-for-diagnosis','uploads/category/546981042_15_09_2020_05_10_41.jpg','<h1>Digital X-ray Center in Baner Pune for Diagnosis</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>We provide treatment for Digital X-ray . Our center is located in baner, balewadi and hinjewadi by the name of&nbsp; Dr SumitZ Orthopaedic and physiotherapy clinic.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Digital radiography is a form of X-ray imaging, where digital X-ray sensors are used instead of traditional photographic film. Advantages include the ability to digitally transfer and enhance images. In addition, less radiation can be used to image the image similar to conventional radiography.</p>\r\n','Digital X-ray Center in Pune for Diagnosis | Dr.Sumitz Clinic ','Dr. Sumitz offers a top-notch medical facility and his Digital X-ray Center in Pune for Diagnosis, which is listed as the top center in Baner and Pune. ','Digital X-ray Center in Pune for Diagnosis, Digital X-ray Center in Baner for Diagnosis, Digital X-ray Center in Pune','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(9,'NUTRITION AND FITNESS TRAINER','nutrition-and-fitness-trainer','uploads/category/491790200_16_09_2020_12_34_59.jpg','<h1>Nutrition and Fitness Trainer</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>We are Dr. Sumitz Orthopaedic and Physiotherapy Clinic provide treatment for the Nutrition and Fitness Trainer Center in Baner, Balewadi and Hinjewadi.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Fitness (biology), a person&#39;s ability to stretch his genes.</li>\r\n	<li>Health (magazine), a women&#39;s magazine that focuses on health and exercise.</li>\r\n	<li>Fitness and figure competition, a form of physique training, is related to bodybuilding.</li>\r\n	<li>A method of fitness approximation, function optimization evolutionary computation or artificial development methods.</li>\r\n	<li>A special type of objective function in fitness function, mathematics and computer science.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','Best Nutrition and Fitness Trainer in Baner | Dr Sumitz Clinic ','Proper diet and nutrition are required for a healthy body. Consult with our best nutrition and fitness trainer in baner and this advice will bring better changes in your life ','Best Nutrition and Fitness Trainer in Baner, Best Nutrition and Fitness Trainer in Pune, Nutrition and Fitness Trainer in Baner, Nutrition and Fitness Trainer in Pune','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(10,'KNEE ARTHRITIS','knee-arthritis','uploads/category/684576017_16_09_2020_01_13_22.jpg','<h1>What is arthritis of the knee?</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Arthritis&nbsp;is a disease that causes pain, swelling, and stiffness in your joints. It can affect the largest and strongest joints in your body. It&rsquo;s common in knees. Arthritis of the knee can be a serious, debilitating disease.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Although there is no cure for knee arthritis, there are steps you can take that might ease your symptoms and potentially slow the progression of your disease.</p>\r\n','Knee Arthritis Treatment in Baner & Pune  | Dr.Sumitz Clinic','Is arthritis locking you inside the door? If yes, then this is the time to get rid of it through our knee arthritis treatment and  clinic in Baner,Pune. ','Knee Arthritis Treatment in Baner, Knee Arthritis Treatment in Pune, Knee Arthritis Treatment Clinic in Baner, Knee Arthritis Treatment Clinic in Pune','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(11,'HIP ARTHRITIS','hip-arthritis','uploads/category/520565339_16_09_2020_03_32_08.jpg','<h1>Arthritis of the Hip</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>One of the most typical reasons for hip pain is arthritis. Since arthritis is a progressive disorder, it normally develops gradually and worsens with time. The definition of arthritis is &quot;inflammation of the joint.&quot;</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Asymptomatic arthritis</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Hip arthritis symptoms, regardless of the type of arthritis, include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Hip joint pain that may also cause groin, outer thigh, or buttock pain</li>\r\n	<li>Pain that usually becomes worse in the morning and gets better with exercise</li>\r\n	<li>walking with difficulty or a limp</li>\r\n	<li>the ache that gets worse after strenuous or prolonged activity</li>\r\n	<li>Hip stiffness or restricted range of motion</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n','Best Hip Arthritis Treatment Doctor in Pune | Dr.Sumitz Clinic','Arthritis of whatever type - the solution to your arthritis is right here. Book your appointment for the best hip arthritis treatment in Pune.','Hip Arthritis Treatment in Pune, Hip Arthritis Treatment in Baner, Hip Arthritis Doctor in Pune, Hip Arthritis Doctor in Baner ','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(12,'SPORT INJURIES','sport-injuries','uploads/category/566946562_03_11_2022_03_29_33.jpg','<h1>Types of sports injuries</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Some of the more common sports injuries include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Ankle sprain &ndash; symptoms include pain, swelling and stiffness.</li>\r\n	<li>Bruises &ndash; a blow can cause small bleeds into the skin.</li>\r\n	<li>Concussion &ndash; mild reversible brain injury from a blow to the head, which may be associated with loss of consciousness. Symptoms include headache, dizziness and short term memory loss.</li>\r\n	<li>Cuts and abrasions &ndash; are usually caused by falls. The knees and hands are particularly prone.</li>\r\n	<li>Dehydration &ndash; losing too much fluid can lead to heat exhaustion and heat stroke.</li>\r\n	<li>Dental damage &ndash; a blow to the jaw can crack, break or dislodge teeth.</li>\r\n	<li>Groin strain &ndash; symptoms include pain and swelling.</li>\r\n	<li>Hamstring strain &ndash; symptoms include pain, swelling and bruising.</li>\r\n	<li>Knee joint injuries &ndash; symptoms include pain, swelling and stiffness. The ligaments, tendons or cartilage can be affected.</li>\r\n	<li>Nose injuries &ndash; either blood nose or broken nose, are caused by a direct blow.</li>\r\n	<li>Stress fractures &ndash; particularly in the lower limbs. The impact of repeated jumping or running on hard surfaces can eventually stress and crack bone.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h2>First aid for sprains, strains and joint injuries</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Suggestions on immediate treatment for sprains, strains and joint injuries, to prevent further damage include:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li><strong>R</strong>est &ndash; keep the injured area supported and avoid using for 48-72 hours.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>I</strong>ce &ndash; apply ice to the injured area for 20 minutes every two hours for the first 48-72 hours.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>C</strong>ompression &ndash; apply a firm elastic bandage over the area, extending above and below the painful site.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>E</strong>levation &ndash; raise the injured area above the level of the heart at all times.</li>\r\n	<li><strong>R</strong>eferral &ndash; as soon as possible, see a doctor.</li>\r\n	<li>No&nbsp;<strong>H</strong>eat &ndash; heat will increase bleeding.</li>\r\n	<li>No&nbsp;<strong>A</strong>lcohol &ndash; alcohol increases bleeding and swelling.</li>\r\n	<li>No&nbsp;<strong>R</strong>unning &ndash; running or exercise increases blood flow, delaying healing.</li>\r\n	<li>No&nbsp;<strong>M</strong>assage &ndash; massage increases swelling and bleeding, also delaying healing.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n',' Best Sports Injuries Treatment Clinic in Baner & Pune | Dr.Sumitz','Sports make you mentally and physically strong - but don’t let the injuries hinder your growth. Get the best sports injury treatment in Baner, Pune.','Sports Injuries Treatment in Baner, Sports Injuries Treatment in Pune, Sports Injuries Clinic in Baner, Sports Injuries Clinic in Pune.','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(13,'BACK AND NECK PAIN','back-and-neck-pain','uploads/category/884931423_16_09_2020_03_40_23.jpg','<h1>What causes pain in the neck and back?</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Even with modern technology, pinpointing the precise reason for neck and back discomfort is challenging. Back and neck discomfort typically have a variety of causes, such as any of the following:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>excessive use, demanding exercise, or incorrect use, such as hard lifting or repetitive motion</li>\r\n	<li>fractures, trauma, or injuries</li>\r\n	<li>Vertebral degeneration is frequently brought on by strains on the muscles and ligaments that support your spine or by aging.</li>\r\n	<li>Infection</li>\r\n	<li>A tumor or a bone spur are examples of abnormal growth.</li>\r\n	<li>Obesity puts pressure on your discs and adds weight to your spine.</li>\r\n	<li>muscle tone issues</li>\r\n	<li>muscle spasm or stress</li>\r\n	<li>Injuries or strain</li>\r\n	<li>muscle or ligament rips</li>\r\n	<li>joint issues like arthritis</li>\r\n	<li>Smoking</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n','Back and Neck Pain Treatment Clinic in Pune | Dr. Sumitz Clinic','Get the best Back & Neck Pain Treatment in Baner, Pune','Back and Neck Pain Treatment in Pune, Back and Neck Pain Treatment in Baner, Back and Neck Pain Clinic in Pune, Back and Neck Pain Clinic in Pune','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(14,'FRACTURES','fractures-treatment-in-pune','uploads/category/621601867_16_09_2020_03_45_00.jpg','<h1>Fracture: Causes</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Physical trauma, overuse, and health conditions that weaken the bones, such as osteoporosis, are the leading causes of bone fractures. Other factors can also increase an individual&rsquo;s risk of sustaining fractures. A fracture is a break in the continuity of a bone. Fractures range from small partial cracks to complete breaks and can occur in any bone. Physical trauma, overuse, and conditions such as osteoporosis are the most common causes of fractures. Additionally, a person&rsquo;s bones typically become weaker through late adulthood. This increases their risk of fracturing a bone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The body can repair most fractures, but medical intervention will usually be necessary to keep the broken bones in place. These interventions can range from external casts and splints to surgical screws and plates.</p>\r\n','Fracture Treatment in Pune | Dr Sumitz Clinic, Baner ','No matter what type of fracture it is, the solution to every problem is in the hands of the best fracture treatment clinic in Baner, Pune. Let’s get connected! ','Fracture Treatment in Pune, Fracture Treatment in Baner','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(15,'OSTEOPOROSIS TREATMENT','osteoporosis-treatment','uploads/category/784293376_16_09_2020_03_52_45.jpg','<h1>OSTEOPOROSIS TREATMENT</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are having osteoporosis therapy, you are taking an important step toward better bone health. However, you may have concerns about your treatment. Is the medicine you&#39;re taking right for you? How long will you have to put up with it? Why does your doctor advise a weekly medication yet your buddy just takes one once a month?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Which osteoporosis drugs are often initially tried?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bisphosphonates are often the first-line therapy for osteoporosis. These are some examples:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Denosumab is administered every six months through shallow injections just under the skin. If you take denosumab, you may have to continue taking it forever until your doctor switches you to another medicine. According to recent study, there is a substantial chance of spinal fractures after discontinuing the medicine, thus it is critical that you take it regularly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What are some of the most prevalent negative effects of bisphosphonate pills?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bisphosphonate tablets&#39; most common negative effects include stomach distress and heartburn. Avoid lying down or bending over for 30 to 60 minutes to prevent the medication from washing back up into the esophagus. Most individuals who follow these guidelines do not experience these negative effects.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The stomach may not absorb bisphosphonate medications effectively. On an empty stomach, take the drug with a large glass of water. Nothing else should go into your stomach for 30 to 60 minutes, after which you may eat, drink other beverages, and take other prescriptions.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Do intravenous bisphosphonates offer any benefits over pill-based bisphosphonates?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bisphosphonates administered intravenously, such as ibandronate and zoledronic acid, do not produce gastrointestinal distress. And for other individuals, scheduling a quarterly or annual injection may be simpler than remembering to take a weekly or monthly tablet.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Some persons have minor flu-like symptoms after receiving intravenous bisphosphonates, however this is generally just after the first infusion. You may mitigate the impact by taking acetaminophen (Tylenol, among other medications) before and after the infusion.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Can osteoporosis drugs cause bone damage?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>A break or fracture in the centre of the thighbone is a relatively unusual side effect of bisphosphonates and denosumab. This injury, known as an atypical femoral fracture, may produce discomfort in the thigh or groin that starts slowly and worsens over time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bisphosphonates and denosumab may also induce osteonecrosis of the jaw, a rare disorder in which a piece of jawbone heals slowly or fails to heal, usually after tooth extraction or other invasive dental procedures. This is more likely in persons with bone cancer who take significantly higher dosages of a bisphosphonate than those generally used for osteoporosis.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Should I discontinue using bisphosphonates?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The longer you take bisphosphonates, the more likely you are to suffer atypical femoral fractures or osteonecrosis of the jaw. As a result, your doctor may advise you to temporarily stop using this sort of medication. This is referred to as a drug holiday.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Even if you stop using the medicine, the good benefits may remain. This is because a bisphosphonate stays in your bone after many years of usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Because of this residual impact, most specialists feel it&#39;s appropriate for patients who are doing well throughout therapy &mdash; those who haven&#39;t broken any bones and are maintaining bone density &mdash; to consider discontinuing their bisphosphonate after five years of usage.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Is it possible to utilize hormones to cure osteoporosis?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Estrogen, often in combination with progestin, was historically widely used to treat osteoporosis. This therapy has been linked to an increased risk of blood clots, endometrial cancer, breast cancer, and perhaps heart problems. It is currently often reserved for women at high risk of fracture who are unable to take other osteoporosis medications.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>When comparing the advantages and hazards of estrogen treatment, women seeking hormone replacement therapy to relieve menopausal symptoms such as hot flashes may consider enhanced bone health. According to current guidelines, take the lowest dosage of hormones for the shortest amount of time.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Raloxifene (Evista) replicates estrogen&#39;s positive effects on bone density in postmenopausal women while avoiding some of estrogen&#39;s dangers. This medication may lower the risk of some forms of breast cancer. Hot flashes are a typical complication. Raloxifene may potentially raise your chances of developing blood clots.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>What is the mechanism of action of osteoporosis medications?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Healthy bones constantly break down and repair throughout your life. Bones break down more rapidly as you age, particularly after menopause. Because bone regeneration cannot keep up, bones degenerate and weaken.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Most osteoporosis drugs operate by slowing the breakdown of your bones. Some function by hastening the process of bone formation. Either process builds bone and lowers the likelihood of fracture.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Which medications aid in the bone-building process?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Bone-building medications include:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Teriparatide (Forteo) is a prescription medication.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Tymlos (abaloparatide)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Romosozumab (Evenity) is an anti-cancer drug.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These medications are normally reserved for those with extremely poor bone density, fractures, or osteoporosis induced by steroid treatment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Teriparatide and abaloparatide must be administered on a daily basis. Because studies in laboratory rats revealed an increase in the incidence of bone cancer, these drugs are not used in individuals who are at high risk of developing bone cancer. So far, there has been no rise in bone cancer in those who have taken these drugs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Romosozumab is administered in the form of a monthly injection at your doctor&#39;s office. It is a new drug and less is known about long-term side effects, but it is not given to people who have recently had a stroke or heart attack. The treatment is terminated after 12 monthly doses.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>These bone-building medications are only effective for one or two years, and the effects fade fast once you stop taking them. To safeguard the newly formed bone, you&#39;ll need to begin taking a bone-stabilizing prescription, such as a bisphosphonate.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Is it possible to cure osteoporosis just with medication?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You should not depend only on medicine to treat your osteoporosis. These activities are also essential:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Exercise. Weight-bearing exercise and activities that enhance balance and posture may help to strengthen bones and lower the risk of fracture. The more active and fit you are as you get older, the less probable it is that you will fall and break a bone.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Excellent nourishment. Eat a balanced diet and make sure you receive adequate calcium and vitamin D.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stop smoking. Cigarette smoking hastens bone loss.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Consume alcohol in moderation. If you must consume alcohol, do it in moderation. That is up to one drink per day for healthy ladies. It would be up to two drinks each day for healthy males.</p>\r\n','Osteoporosis Treatment Clinic in Pune  | Dr. Sumitz Clinic ','Get osteoporosis treatment to keep your bones strong and healthy for the rest of your life with the cooperation of the osteoporosis treatment clinic in Pune.','Osteoporosis Treatment in Pune, Osteoporosis Treatment in Baner, Best Osteoporosis Treatment in Pune, Best Osteoporosis Treatment in Baner','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(16,'FROZEN SHOULDER TREATMENT','frozen-shoulder-treatment','uploads/category/561195544_16_09_2020_04_00_52.jpg','<h1>Surgical and non-surgical procedures in Frozen Shoulder -&nbsp;</h1>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nThe majority of frozen shoulders resolve on their own within 12 to 18 months. Other therapies for severe or chronic symptoms include:</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\nInjections of steroids. Injecting corticosteroids into the shoulder joint may help reduce discomfort and increase shoulder mobility, particularly if done immediately after the onset of frozen shoulder.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Hydrodilatation. Injecting sterile water into the joint capsule may expand the tissue and make movement easier. This is occasionally used in conjunction with a steroid injection.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Manipulation of the shoulders. This operation uses a medicine known as a general anesthesia, which renders you unconscious and painless. The care provider will then rotate the shoulder joint in various directions to assist relax the constricted tissue.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Surgery. Frozen shoulder surgery is uncommon. Surgery, on the other hand, may remove scar tissue from within the shoulder joint if nothing else works. Typically, this surgery entails creating small incisions for small tools that are directed by a tiny camera within the joint (arthroscopy).</p>\r\n','Frozen Shoulder Treatment Clinic in Baner  | Dr.SumitZ Clinic','If a frozen shoulder problem is bothering you, then the doors of the frozen shoulder treatment clinic in Baner by Dr. Sumit are open for you. Book the appointments today ','Frozen shoulder Treatment in Baner, Frozen shoulder Treatment in Pune, Frozen shoulder Center in Pune, Frozen shoulder Center in Baner','Best Orthopaedic in Balewadi | Best Orthopaedic in pune | Best Orthopaedic Doctor',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(17,'Chiropractic','chiropractic','uploads/category/673135418_18_07_2023_03_11_10.jpg','<h1>Chiropractic&nbsp;Treatment</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Chiropractic adjustment is a treatment in which trained experts (chiropractors) apply a regulated, abrupt force to a spinal joint using their hands or a tiny device. The purpose of this therapy, also known as spinal manipulation, is to enhance spinal mobility and physical function in your body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Why is it done?</strong><br />\r\nThe most frequent conditions for which patients seek chiropractic care are low back pain, neck discomfort, and headaches.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<strong>What to anticipate-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>During your first appointment, your chiropractor will ask you questions about your medical history and do a physical exam, paying special attention to your spine. Other exams or tests, including as X-rays, may be recommended by your chiropractor.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Throughout the treatment-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>A typical chiropractic adjustment involves your chiropractor positioning you in precise postures to address afflicted regions. You are often positioned facedown on a specially built, cushioned chiropractic table. The chiropractor applies a controlled, abrupt force to a joint, pushing it beyond its normal range of motion. During the treatment session, you may hear popping or cracking noises as the chiropractor rotates your joints.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Following the process-</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>After a chiropractic adjustment, some persons suffer minimal side effects for a few days. These may include headaches, lethargy, or soreness in the treated areas of the body.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Results-&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Chiropractic adjustments may be useful in treating low back pain, while most studies indicate just a little improvement &ndash; equivalent to the findings of more conventional therapies. According to certain research, spinal manipulation may also be beneficial for headaches and other spine-related illnesses such as neck discomfort.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Chiropractic adjustments do not work for everyone. A lot depends on your specific scenario. If your symptoms do not improve after a few weeks of therapy, chiropractic adjustments may not be the ideal solution for you.</p>\r\n','Chiropractic adjustment in Baner, Pune - DrSumitz ','Chiropractic adjustments do not work for everyone. A lot depends on your specific scenario. If your symptoms do not improve after a few weeks of therapy, chiropractic adjustments may not be the ideal solution for you.','','',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(18,'Viscosupplementation  Injection','viscosupplementation-injection-treatment-pune','uploads/category/422668204_16_04_2024_02_28_09.webp','<h1>Viscosupplementation for Osteoarthritis of the Knee</h1>\r\n\r\n<p>Osteoarthritis is a disorder that affects some people who have knee discomfort all the time. Osteoarthritis is a degenerative joint condition, as opposed to the transient pain and inflammation that an excessive immune system reaction might generate in a joint.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Osteoarthritis primarily affects the cartilage. Cartilage is the tissue that envelops the ends of the bones in a joint. When cartilage is in good health, it acts as a &quot;shock absorber&quot; and permits bones to move smoothly over one another. A tiny quantity of synovial fluid, a viscous, gel-like fluid that cushions the joint and lubricates it to lower friction, is also present in a normal knee joint.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Viscosupplementation injection treatment in Balewadi is a popular treatment option for those suffering from osteoarthritis. This minimally invasive procedure involves injecting a gel-like substance into the joint to provide cushioning and lubrication. Many patients experience reduced pain and improved mobility after receiving this treatment. So if you are someone who doesn&rsquo;t want any kind of surgery or painful treatment to treat osteoarthritis, then Viscosupplementation Injection Treatment in Baner is just for you.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Contact Dr. Sumitz, an <a href=\"https://www.drsumitz.com/services/orthopaedic-center\"><strong>orthopaedic clinic in Balewadi </strong></a>or Baner, today to see if a viscosupplementation injection is right for you.</p>\r\n','Viscosupplementation Injection Treatment for Knee Arthritis in Balewadi | Dr Sumitz Clinic ','Get  top-notch Viscosupplementation Injection treatment for knee arthritis at Dr. Sumitz Clinic in Baner, Pune. Trust the expertise of the best doctor for effective relief and improved mobility. Book your appointment now!','','',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(19,'Cupping Therapy Treatment','cupping-therapy-treatment','uploads/category/220661905_28_01_2026_02_34_33.png','<p>Cupping Therapy is an effective therapeutic technique that uses controlled suction to improve blood circulation, release muscle tension, and accelerate the body&rsquo;s natural healing response. At Dr SumitZ, we provide advanced <strong>cupping therapy in Pune</strong> as part of a comprehensive orthopedic and physiotherapy approach for pain relief, injury recovery, and muscular rehabilitation.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients often search for <strong>cupping therapy near me</strong> when they experience chronic back pain, neck stiffness, shoulder tightness, or sports-related muscle fatigue. Our clinic in Baner offers personalised cupping sessions, making us a trusted choice for those looking for the <strong>best cupping therapy near me</strong> under medical supervision.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Types of Cupping Therapy Offered</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Dry Cupping Therapy</strong><br />\r\nDry cupping therapy involves placing suction cups on specific muscle groups without any incisions. This form of suction therapy helps lift tight tissues, increase blood flow, and reduce muscle knots. It is especially effective for posture-related pain, desk-job stiffness, and athletic recovery.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Hot Cupping</strong><br />\r\nHot cupping uses heat inside the cups to create a deeper suction effect. This technique penetrates deeper muscle layers, helping relieve long-standing stiffness, improve flexibility, and promote relaxation. Hot cupping is commonly used for chronic back pain and muscle tightness.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Wet Cupping Therapy</strong><br />\r\nWet cupping therapy involves superficial skin incisions followed by suction to remove stagnant blood and toxins. This method is recommended in selected cases of chronic inflammation and pain and is always performed using strict hygiene and safety protocols.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Benefits of Cupping Therapy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Improves blood circulation and oxygen supply</li>\r\n	<li>Relieves chronic muscle and joint pain</li>\r\n	<li>Reduces inflammation and muscle stiffness</li>\r\n	<li>Enhances muscle recovery after injury</li>\r\n	<li>Promotes relaxation and stress relief</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients frequently inquire about <strong>cupping therapy prices in Pune</strong>. At Dr SumitZ, pricing depends on the type of cupping, number of cups used, and treatment duration, with complete transparency and no hidden costs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you are dealing with persistent muscle pain or restricted movement, choosing professional <strong>cupping therapy near me can</strong> be a natural, safe, and highly effective solution.</p>\r\n','Cupping Therapy in Baner Pune | Fire Cup & Hijama Therapy - Dr SumitZ Clinic','Experience cupping therapy in Baner, Balewadi & Pune with Dr SumitZ. Fire cup treatment, hijama therapy & suction therapy for pain relief, blood circulation & wellness.','Cupping Therapy in Baner Pune, Hijama Therapy in Baner Balewadi, Cupping Therapy Benefits, Physiotherapy Doctor in Baner Balewadi','',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(20,'Dry Needling Therapy','dry-needling-therapy','uploads/category/388603314_28_01_2026_02_37_43.png','<p>Dry Needling Therapy is a modern and evidence-based physiotherapy technique designed to relieve muscular pain, deactivate trigger points, and restore normal movement patterns. If you are searching for <strong>dry needling near me</strong>, <strong>needle therapy near me</strong>, or <strong>needling near me</strong>, Dr SumitZ offers expert dry needling treatments performed by trained professionals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dry needling involves inserting thin, sterile needles into tight muscle bands known as trigger points. These trigger points often cause referred pain, stiffness, and reduced mobility. By targeting these areas, dry needling helps release tension and improves muscle function.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conditions Treated with Dry Needling</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Chronic neck and lower back pain</li>\r\n	<li>Shoulder pain and frozen shoulder</li>\r\n	<li>Sports injuries and muscle strain</li>\r\n	<li>Sciatica and nerve-related pain</li>\r\n	<li>Postural muscle imbalance</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Many patients prefer combining <strong>dry needling and massage near me</strong> or <strong>massage and dry needling near me</strong>, as this approach accelerates recovery by relaxing muscles and improving circulation. We also provide <strong>needle massage therapy near me</strong> for patients requiring deeper muscle release.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Benefits of Dry Needling Therapy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Immediate reduction in muscle tightness</li>\r\n	<li>Improved joint mobility and flexibility</li>\r\n	<li>Faster recovery from injuries</li>\r\n	<li>Reduced nerve irritation</li>\r\n	<li>Long-term pain management</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>People often search for the <strong>best dry needling near me</strong> and want clarity on <strong>dry needling prices near me</strong>. At Dr SumitZ, treatment plans are customised based on pain severity, number of sessions required, and individual recovery goals.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Dry needling is safe, minimally invasive, and highly effective when performed by trained professionals, making it an ideal solution for chronic muscular pain.</p>\r\n','Dry Needling Therapy in Baner Balewadi | Dr SumitZ Clinic','Get expert dry needling therapy in Baner, Balewadi & Pune. Dr SumitZ provides dry needling treatment, physiotherapy, and pain relief for muscle issues.','Dry Needling Therapy Baner Pune, Dry Needling Physiotherapy Baner Balewadi, Dr SumitZ Clinic Baner Balewadi','',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(21,'MFR Therapy (Myofascial Release Therapy)','mfr-therapy-myofascial-release-therapy','uploads/category/745884275_28_01_2026_02_39_48.png','<p>MFR Therapy, also known as <strong>Myofascial Release</strong>, is a specialised hands-on manual therapy focused on releasing tight fascia&mdash;the connective tissue that surrounds muscles, joints, and nerves throughout the body. When fascia becomes restricted, it can lead to persistent pain, stiffness, and reduced mobility. If you are searching for <strong>MFR therapy near me</strong> or <strong>myofascial therapy near me</strong>, this treatment is highly effective for managing long-standing pain conditions and movement limitations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>What Is Myofascial Release?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Fascia can become tight or dehydrated due to injuries, poor posture, repetitive movements, prolonged sitting, stress, or surgical trauma. <strong>MFR myofascial release</strong> works by applying sustained pressure and gentle stretching using proven <strong>myofascial release techniques</strong>. These techniques help release fascial restrictions, improve tissue elasticity, enhance blood circulation, and restore natural movement patterns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unlike forceful techniques, myofascial release is slow, controlled, and patient-specific, allowing the body to respond and heal naturally.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conditions Treated with MFR Therapy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>MFR Therapy is commonly recommended for:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Chronic neck and back pain</li>\r\n	<li>Postural imbalance and muscular tightness</li>\r\n	<li>Sports injuries and overuse conditions</li>\r\n	<li>Fibromyalgia and widespread muscle pain</li>\r\n	<li>Restricted joint mobility and stiffness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our treatment approach includes <strong>myofascial muscle release</strong>, <strong>myofascial trigger point therapy</strong>, and advanced <strong>fascia release</strong> techniques tailored to each patient&rsquo;s condition. We also use specialised <strong>myofascial massage techniques</strong> and <strong>fascia myofascial release</strong> to address deeper layers of connective tissue for more effective and long-lasting relief.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients searching for <strong>MFR treatment</strong>, <strong>MFR release</strong>, or <strong>myofascial therapy</strong> often experience reduced muscle stiffness, improved flexibility, better posture, and long-term pain relief when therapy is performed consistently under professional guidance.</p>\r\n','MFR Therapy in Baner Pune | Myofascial Release Therapy by Dr SumitZ','Get expert MFR therapy in Baner, Balewadi & Pune. Dr SumitZ offers myofascial release therapy, muscle fascia release & trigger point treatment for pain relief.','MFR Therapy in Baner Balewadi, Myofascial Release Therapy in Baner Balewadi,  Dr SumitZ Clinic Baner Balewadi','',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22'),(22,'Chiropractor Therapy','chiropractor-therapy','uploads/category/845747115_28_01_2026_02_41_12.png','<p>MFR Therapy, also known as <strong>Myofascial Release</strong>, is a specialised hands-on manual therapy focused on releasing tight fascia&mdash;the connective tissue that surrounds muscles, joints, and nerves throughout the body. When fascia becomes restricted, it can lead to persistent pain, stiffness, and reduced mobility. If you are searching for <strong>MFR therapy near me</strong> or <strong>myofascial therapy near me</strong>, this treatment is highly effective for managing long-standing pain conditions and movement limitations.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>What Is Myofascial Release?</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>Fascia can become tight or dehydrated due to injuries, poor posture, repetitive movements, prolonged sitting, stress, or surgical trauma. <strong>MFR myofascial release</strong> works by applying sustained pressure and gentle stretching using proven <strong>myofascial release techniques</strong>. These techniques help release fascial restrictions, improve tissue elasticity, enhance blood circulation, and restore natural movement patterns.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Unlike forceful techniques, myofascial release is slow, controlled, and patient-specific, allowing the body to respond and heal naturally.</p>\r\n\r\n<h3><strong>Conditions Treated with MFR Therapy</strong></h3>\r\n\r\n<p>MFR Therapy is commonly recommended for:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n	<li>Chronic neck and back pain</li>\r\n	<li>Postural imbalance and muscular tightness</li>\r\n	<li>Sports injuries and overuse conditions</li>\r\n	<li>Fibromyalgia and widespread muscle pain</li>\r\n	<li>Restricted joint mobility and stiffness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>Our treatment approach includes <strong>myofascial muscle release</strong>, <strong>myofascial trigger point therapy</strong>, and advanced <strong>fascia release</strong> techniques tailored to each patient&rsquo;s condition. We also use specialised <strong>myofascial massage techniques</strong> and <strong>fascia myofascial release</strong> to address deeper layers of connective tissue for more effective and long-lasting relief.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Patients searching for <strong>MFR treatment</strong>, <strong>MFR release</strong>, or <strong>myofascial therapy</strong> often experience reduced muscle stiffness, improved flexibility, better posture, and long-term pain relief when therapy is performed consistently under professional guidance.</p>\r\n','Best Chiropractor in Baner Pune | Chiropractic Therapy by Dr SumitZ','Dr SumitZ is a trusted chiropractor in Baner Balewadi offering expert chiropractic therapy, chirotherapy & pain relief treatments. Book an appointment today.','Chiropractor in Baner Pune, Best Chiropractor in Baner Balewadi , Chiropractic Massage in Baner Balewadi, Dr SumitZ Clinic Baner','',1,NULL,'2026-07-15 04:30:22','2026-07-15 04:30:22');
